  "Adictivo Cristalino|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Adictivo Cristalino's añejo-pour depth sits alongside the chickpea soup's roasted-pepper chickpea warmth: the rested-agave depth sits with the chickpea soup, and the caramel-agave register brightens the bowl. Works; crystallino-filtered complexity handles richness at trendy-luxury register.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Salt-Cured Halibut": "Adictivo Cristalino's caramel-char character sits with the halibut's salt-cured flesh — the crisp body frames the fish cleanly, and the caramel rounds the umami plate. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Sauteed Garlic Spinach": "Adictivo Cristalino's rested-agave body finds neutral with the garlic spinach's garlic-buttered greens: the rested-agave depth sits with the garlic spinach, and the cooked-agave note underlines the side. Works; accessible aged composed with this dish.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Seafood Tower": "Adictivo Cristalino with the seafood tower — filtered aged across raw oysters, shrimp, lobster. The cristalino's aged depth with clear presentation elevates the tower's premium theatrics; pour for a table that wants the distinctive story. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Seared Scallops": "Adictivo Cristalino with seared scallops — filtered aged tequila against caramelized scallop. The aged-but-clear character meets the sear with more depth than standard blancos while preserving visual blanco clarity. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Seasonal Soup": "Adictivo Cristalino's rested-agave body reads alongside the seasonal soup's house seasonal build: the barrel-rested body handles the seasonal soup, and the oak threads the bowl. Works; clean and composed pairing.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Seasonal Vegetables": "Adictivo Cristalino's aged-agave character reads alongside the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the oak-aged tequila body threads the seasonal vegetables, and the soft-spice note softens the side. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Shrimp Bisque": "Adictivo Cristalino with shrimp bisque — filtered cristalino against cream-based seafood. Strong; aged-but-clear character sits with the bisque with distinctive craft depth.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Shrimp Cocktail": "Adictivo Cristalino with shrimp cocktail — filtered cristalino against cold shrimp. The distinctive aged-but-clear character threads through cocktail sauce with craft-theatrical presentation. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Swordfish": "Adictivo Cristalino's añejo-pour depth meets at register with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak: the aged-agave weight wraps the swordfish, and the soft-spice note softens the plate. Strong; the pairing isn't the draw, the presentation is.",
