  "Adictivo Cristalino|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Adictivo Cristalino's rested-agave body leans against the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust: the rested-agave depth sits with the tuna, and the cooked-agave note underlines the plate. Strong; modern cleanness is capable but the starter earns a more character-forward reposado.",
  "Adictivo Cristalino|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Adictivo Cristalino's añejo-pour depth finds neutral with the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the barrel-rested body handles the curry, and the cooked-agave note underlines the bowl. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Asparagus": "Adictivo Reposado's rested-agave body finds neutral with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the añejo register carries the asparagus, and the cooked-agave note underlines the side. Works; crystallino-filtered complexity handles richness at trendy-luxury register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Adictivo Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register reads alongside the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the barrel-rested body handles the au gratin, and the oak threads the side. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Beignets": "Adictivo Reposado's barrel-aged tequila weight leans against the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the oak-aged tequila body threads the beignets, and the oak threads the dessert. Works; aged-but-clear character composes with the dish.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Bone Marrow": "Adictivo Reposado with bone marrow — long-aged reposado against umami fat. The near-añejo depth meets the marrow's intensity where 8-month reposados don't quite reach. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Bone-In Filet": "Adictivo Reposado's barrel-aged tequila weight leans against the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the rested-agave depth sits with the bone-enhanced filet, and the soft-spice note softens the cut. Strong; the extra proof cuts through the dairy with more conviction than softer reposados.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Broccoli Cheddar": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth sits alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the aged-agave weight wraps the broccoli cheddar, and the soft-spice note softens the bowl. Works; the smoothness doesn't drive the pairing but the theatrics do.",
