  "Adictivo Reposado|Butternut Squash": "Adictivo Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the barrel-rested body handles the squash bisque, and the oak threads the bowl. Works; multi-cask complexity composed with this dish at distinctive register.",
