  "Adictivo Reposado|Chocolate Cake": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth sits alongside the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the barrel-rested body handles the chocolate cake, and the cooked-agave note underlines the dessert. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Clam Chowder": "Adictivo Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the oak-aged tequila body threads the chowder, and the soft-spice note softens the bowl. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Cowboy Ribeye": "Adictivo Reposado with the Cowboy Ribeye — near-añejo reposado against cap fat and char. The extended maturation earns this cut where younger reposados fade; Adictivo and G4 High Proof are the two reposados that handle the ribeye. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Crab Cake": "Adictivo Reposado with crab cake — long-aged reposado against lump crab. The extended-maturation oak gives the pairing more weight than everyday reposados bring to delicate seafood. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
