  "Adictivo Reposado|Escargot": "Adictivo Reposado's crisp agave-caramel character lifts the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the añejo depth cuts the umami fat, and the caramel rounds the umami plate. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Faroe Island Salmon": "Adictivo Reposado with the salmon — near-añejo reposado against salmon richness. Strong; the aged depth frames the salmon with more gravitas than younger reposados.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Filet Mignon": "Adictivo Reposado with the filet — extended-maturation reposado against the 10oz cut. The near-añejo depth gives the filet a richer frame than standard reposados; a premium extended-aged call. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|French Onion": "Adictivo Reposado's aged-agave character reads alongside the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the French onion, and the soft-spice note softens the bowl. Works; the wine influence is unusual here but doesn't quite drive.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Grilled Caesar": "Adictivo Reposado with the grilled Caesar — long-aged reposado against charred romaine. Strong; the rich oak earns the Caesar where standard reposados only work.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Gumbo": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth reads alongside the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the aged-agave weight wraps the gumbo, and the cooked-agave note underlines the bowl. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Adictivo Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the barrel-rested body handles the honey carrots, and the oak threads the side. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|House Wedge": "Adictivo Reposado with the House Wedge — extended-aged reposado against iceberg and bleu. The rich oak gives the salad a depth beyond what Don Julio or Corazon bring. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Kansas City": "Kansas City: strip marbling meets Adictivo Reposado — long-aged reposado pushing into near-añejo territory. Rich oak, caramel, concentrated; extended maturation gives the strip a fuller-bodied frame than everyday 8-month-aged pours. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Loaded Potato": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth reads alongside the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the aged-agave weight wraps the loaded potato soup, and the oak threads the bowl. Works; accessible aged composed with this dish.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Lobster Mac": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the rested-agave depth sits with the lobster mac, and the cooked-agave note underlines the side. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Market Fish": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth leans against the market fish's clean white-fish flesh: the barrel-rested body handles the market fish, and the soft-spice note softens the plate. Works; Ultra's ceremonial depth composed with this dish.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Mocha Creme": "Adictivo Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register reads alongside the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness: the aged-agave weight wraps the mocha creme, and the caramel-agave register brightens the dessert. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Mushroom Bisque": "Adictivo Reposado's rested-agave body sits alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the añejo register carries the mushroom bisque, and the cooked-agave note underlines the bowl. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Mushrooms": "Adictivo Reposado with the mushrooms — extended-maturation reposado against earthy umami. Strong; rich oak layers into mushroom depth with aged-reposado complexity.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Adictivo Reposado's aged-agave character reads alongside the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the añejo register carries the PB brownie, and the cooked-agave note underlines the dessert. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Adictivo Reposado|Porterhouse": "Adictivo Reposado's añejo-pour depth matches register with the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character: the rested-agave depth sits with the dual-cut steak, and the caramel-agave register brightens the cut. Strong; cristalino depth cuts the garlic-butter with craft-theatrical distinctiveness.",
