  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Beignets": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's rounded-oak bourbon character sits alongside the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the beignets, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; AE Triple Cask handles the richness at distinctive register.",
