  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Broccoli Cheddar": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone sits alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon depth settles into the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; boutique-release covers both cuts without standing out.",
