  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Brussels and Belly": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight sits alongside Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the bourbon body sits with the pork-belly plate, and the vanilla balances the char-and-fat. Works; the pour's assertiveness is a bit much for the soup but doesn't clash; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
