  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Butternut Squash": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's soft-oak bourbon body reads alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the caramel-spice register matches the squash bisque, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; cleaner than wheated versions but not exceptional.",
  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Carrot Cake": "AE Cask Strength with carrot cake — 117+ proof port-finish against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; AE CS's cask-strength port-fruit threads the cake at premium wine-finish register; flagship AE still holds the featured carrot-cake position.",
