  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Chocolate Brownie": "Chocolate Brownie: warm cocoa meets annual limited AE port-finish at 117+ proof cask-strength, more intense than flagship. AE CS's port-finish-at-cask-strength is the featured wine-finished-bourbon-chocolate pairing at premium register — port-and-chocolate at higher proof brings more jammy-cocoa intensity than flagship AE. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Chocolate Cake": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the bourbon body sits with the chocolate cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; milestone-edition over-specified.",
  "Angel's Envy Cask Strength|Clam Chowder": "Angel's Envy Cask Strength's soft-oak bourbon body finds neutral with the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the brown-spirit warmth threads the chowder, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; Boss Hog's allocation story is wasted on the salad.",
