  "Angel's Envy|Cowboy Ribeye": "Angel's Envy with the cowboy ribeye — 86.6 proof port-finished against 26oz bone-in cap-fat. Strong; AE is under-specified for cap-fat at flagship proof; AE Cask Strength handles this better.",
