  "Asparagus|Dewar's White Label": "Dewar's White Label's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the scotch backbone matches the asparagus, and the malt-driven sweetness softens the side. Works; Voyage 23 handles the richness at ocean-finish register.",
