  "Asparagus|Doctor Bird Jamaica Rum": "Doctor Bird Jamaica Rum's rich layered-spirit body leans against the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the rich pour wraps the asparagus, and the deep backbone frames the side. Works; composed but not a standout.",
