  "Asparagus|Yamazaki 12 Year": "Yamazaki 12 Year's Suntory Japanese flagship character finds neutral with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the Japanese whisky balance frames the asparagus, and the sandalwood-and-honey register softens the side. Works; IW Harper 15 frames the two-cut plate at aged-KY-heritage register.",
  "Asparagus|Yamazaki 18 Year": "Yamazaki 18 Year's aged Suntory mizunara character leans against the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the restrained whisky body threads the asparagus, and the umami-tinged finish frames the side. Works; namesake pour is wasted on the salad.",
  "Asparagus|Yellow Chartreuse": "Yellow Chartreuse's bitter-herb aperitivo edge clashes with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge -- bitter aperitivo on the supporting side reads as wrong register for the course. The plate deserves Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, Joseph Mellot Sancerre, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Hold the Yellow Chartreuse for the steak course.",
