  "Au Gratin Potatoes|Austin Hope Cabernet Sauvignon": "Au Gratin Potatoes: the structured red's grip carries the rich side's dairy load; oak-driven body absorbs the cream and tannin clears the finish. A capable pair; richness aligns if not perfectly. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
