  "Au Gratin Potatoes|Baileys Irish Cream": "Baileys Irish Cream's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust -- sweet liqueur and dairy-rich side double the indulgence with no contrast. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, not a digestif. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Reserve the Baileys Irish Cream for the steak course.",
