  "Au Gratin Potatoes|Basil Hayden's Red Wine Cask": "Basil Hayden's Red Wine Cask with the au gratin — BH high-rye red-wine finish against cheese-and-cream potatoes. Works; BH Red Wine Cask handles the richness at distinctive register.",
