  "Au Gratin Potatoes|Codigo 1530 Rosa": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the au gratin, and the cooked-agave note underlines the side. Works; composed but not a standout.",
