  "Balvenie 16 Single Barrel|Mushrooms": "Balvenie 16 Single Barrel with mushrooms — single-barrel First Fill American Oak against earthy umami. Strong; Balvenie 16's deeper vanilla threads mushroom earthiness; Cragganmore 12's subtle smoke is still the featured Speyside-mushroom pairing.",
  "Balvenie 16 Single Barrel|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Balvenie 16 Single Barrel with the PB brownie — hand-picked American Oak Speyside against peanut butter and cocoa. Excellent; Balvenie 16's deep vanilla marries the dessert density — the featured Speyside-PB-brownie pairing across the whole cluster, where Balvenie 12's vanilla opens it, Balvenie 16's depth closes it.",
