  "Balvenie 21 Portwood|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Balvenie 21 Portwood's aged Port-finished Speyside sits alongside the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the malt-and-oak threads the curry, and the heather brightens the bowl. Works; a gentle composed match.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Asparagus": "Bardstown Château Laboude's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone sits alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the asparagus, and the caramel rounds the side. Works; the 10-year BIB depth gives the dessert substantial weight.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Au Gratin Potatoes: cheese-and-cream potatoes meet Bardstown Bourbon Co. French-wine finish. Works; Bardstown Château Laboude handles the richness at contemporary-craft register.",
