  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Broccoli Cheddar": "Bardstown Château Laboude's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone reads alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon depth settles into the broccoli cheddar, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the cream. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Broccolini": "Bardstown Château Laboude's grain-and-oak bourbon register leans against the broccolini's tender green stalks: the oak depth lays under the broccolini, and the oak frames the side. Works; blended character doesn't drive.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Brussels and Belly": "Bardstown Château Laboude's soft-oak bourbon body leans against Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the oak depth lays under the pork-belly plate, and the vanilla brightens the grilled char-edge. Works; Kentucky Owl is over-specified for a side — save the collector bottle for the main; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
