  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Creamy Potato": "Bardstown Château Laboude's grain-and-oak bourbon register sits alongside the potato soup's silky-bodied cream: the bourbon body sits with the potato soup, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; master-blender doesn't drive.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Creme Brulee": "Bardstown Château Laboude with creme brulee — Bardstown Bourbon Co. French-wine finish against vanilla custard and caramelized sugar. Strong; Bardstown Château Laboude's French-wine-fruit finds the caramel at contemporary-craft register.",
  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Escargot": "Bardstown Château Laboude's vanilla character matches the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the whiskey weight reads cleanly against the umami plate, and the oak frames the umami. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
