  "Bardstown Château Laboude|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Bardstown Château Laboude's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the bourbon backbone carries the honey carrots, and the oak frames the caramelized sugar. Works; the bonded richness gives the dessert more than lighter pours do.",
