  "Bardstown Discovery #6|Escargot": "Bardstown Discovery #6's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth sits alongside the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the brown-spirit warmth threads the buttered escargot, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; wine-cask complexity sits with richness; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
