  "Bardstown Founders KBS|Seasonal Vegetables": "Bardstown Founders KBS's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the caramel-spice register matches the seasonal vegetables, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the side. Works; bonded weight a touch ambitious for the dessert.",
