  "Beignets|Cragganmore 12": "Cragganmore 12's complex Speyside character leans against the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the scotch depth settles into the beignets, and the oak-and-smoke underlines the dessert. Works; allocated character doesn't drive.",
  "Beignets|Creamed Spinach": "The creamed spinach alongside the beignets -- rich cream gives way to sweet, the close lands generously. Works; the contrast holds, neither course overshadows the other.",
