  "Beignets|Empress 1908 Gin": "Empress 1908 with beignets — rose-ginger-fennel Victoria craft against fried dough. Excellent; Empress's rose-and-floral profile is the featured Smooth/Citrus Craft Gin-beignets pairing — rose-with-sugar is a distinctive dessert bridge no other Smooth/Citrus sibling brings.",
