  "Beignets|Long Road Gin": "Long Road Gin's botanical-driven lift fights the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- gin's herbal edge has no foil against warm pastry sugar — sharp meets sweet, neither wins. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a gin. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Hold the Long Road Gin for the steak course.",
  "Beignets|Los Vecinos Mezcal": "Los Vecinos Mezcal's wood-fire mezcal body reads alongside the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the earthen-pit smoke carries the beignets, and the campfire register frames the dessert. Works; the side-salad call holds.",
