  "Beignets|Negroni": "Gin, Contratto vermouth, Campari — equal parts, bitter and herbal. The Campari's edge clashes with beignet sweetness; Negroni's savory-bitter profile belongs with mushrooms or marrow, not with a light dessert. Wrong cocktail here. Avoid; the pairing fights at the table — point the guest elsewhere.",
