  "Blanton's Gold|Shrimp Bisque": "Blanton's Gold's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone reads alongside the shrimp bisque's creamy shellfish soup: the bourbon body sits with the shrimp bisque, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; EC 18's aged character meets the glaze at aged-HH register.",
