  "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel|Seafood Tower": "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth fights the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- the spirit register reads heavy on a starter's lighter frame. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a bourbon. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Blanton's Straight from the Barrel lands on the steak course — not here.",
