  "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel's grain-and-oak bourbon register leans against the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the bourbon depth settles into the curry, and the oak frames the bowl. Works; CC 43 Year is over-specified for a side; save the rare bottle for the main.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Asparagus": "Blood Oath Pact 10's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight finds neutral with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the bourbon depth settles into the asparagus, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the side. Works; bonded weight slightly over-specified.",
