  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Beignets": "Blood Oath Pact 10's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth finds neutral with the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the bourbon body sits with the beignets, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; the toast notes don't really interplay with the soup but don't clash.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Bone Marrow": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with bone marrow — 10th-Pact milestone against umami fat. The decennial release complexity meets marrow with collector-edition authority. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Bone-In Filet": "Blood Oath Pact 10's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the bourbon backbone carries the bone-enhanced filet, and the oak-and-spice register settles the cut. Strong; EHT Full Proof meets the earthy-rich at historic Kentucky register.",
