  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Brussels and Belly": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with Brussels + Belly — 10th-Pact milestone meets maple-glazed pork belly. The decennial-release character cuts the glaze with milestone-collector distinctiveness. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Burrata": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with burrata — fresh dairy against decennial Pact 10. Avoid; lead with the alts on the menu.",
