  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Carrot Cake": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with carrot cake — decennial Pact 10 against cream cheese and cinnamon. Works; milestone-release finds cake spice with 10th-Pact collector character.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Cheesecake": "Blood Oath Pact 10's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the oak depth lays under the cheesecake, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; the 100-proof is a touch over-specified for the dessert's register.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Chilean Seabass": "Blood Oath Pact 10's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- bourbon weight needs red meat, not the salmon's already-rich oils. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Save the Blood Oath Pact 10 for the steak course.",
