  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Cowboy Ribeye": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with the Cowboy Ribeye — decennial 10th Pact against cap fat. The milestone-release character gives the ribeye collector-level annual-Pact depth. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Crab Cake": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with crab cake — decennial milestone Pact against delicate crab. Avoid; save the 10th-Pact collector bottle.",
