  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Creme Brulee": "Blood Oath Pact 10's grain-and-oak bourbon register sits alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the caramel-spice register matches the brulee, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; Boss Hog's allocation story is wasted on the salad.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Escargot": "Blood Oath Pact 10's mineral-spice character finds register with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the caramel-oak depth threads the savory plate, and the mineral edge mirrors the briny meat. Strong; a steady recommendation at the table.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Faroe Island Salmon": "Blood Oath Pact 10's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth swallows the salmon's rich oily flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a bourbon. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Save the Blood Oath Pact 10 for the steak course.",
