  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Kansas City": "Blood Oath Pact 10 with the KC — the decennial 10th Pact, 2024 milestone release from master blender John Rempe. A milestone collector edition within the Blood Oath series; 10 years of annual releases culminate here. The strip gets the milestone-Pact blender-signature frame. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Loaded Potato": "Blood Oath Pact 10's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth finds neutral with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the bourbon weight handles the loaded potato soup, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; the complex character gives the dessert a refined frame.",
  "Blood Oath Pact 10|Lobster Mac": "Blood Oath Pact 10's soft-oak bourbon body reads alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; the Dylan-brand story is wasted on the salad.",
