  "Bone-In Filet|Bardstown Rishi's Single Barrel": "Bardstown Rishi's Single Barrel's rounded-oak bourbon character sits alongside the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the bourbon depth settles into the bone-enhanced filet, and the vanilla softens the cut. Strong; curated character covers the cut.",
  "Bone-In Filet|Basil Hayden's": "Basil Hayden's crisp high-rye-pepper character frames the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the bourbon depth carries the cut. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
