  "Bone-In Filet|Bodega Noemia A Lisa": "Bodega Noemia A Lisa's bold earth-floral cassis finds register with the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the velvety body lifts the lean cut, and the cassis plays against the grilled char. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
