  "Bone-In Filet|Dunville's Single Malt": "Dunville's Single Malt's Irish whiskey smoothness reads alongside the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the malt-grain blend handles the bone-enhanced filet, and the triple-distilled smoothness brightens the cut. Works; composed but not a standout.",
