  "Bone-In Filet|El Mayor Extra Anejo": "El Mayor Extra Anejo with the bone-in filet — accessible premium extra añejo against bone-in cut. The aged El Mayor frames the cut at value-adjacent premium register. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
