  "Bone-In Filet|Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak": "Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak's bold double-oak-vanilla character holds steady against the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the bourbon depth supports the lean cut without overpowering, and the vanilla softens the grilled char. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
