  "Bone-In Filet|Komos Anejo Reserva": "Komos Anejo Reserva's wine-finish-caramel character holds the line with the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the aged-tequila depth carries the cut, and the caramel echoes the grilled char. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
