  "Bone-In Filet|Mister Sam Tribute Whiskey": "Mister Sam with the bone-in filet — Sazerac Seagram's-tribute blended whiskey against tenderloin-with-bone. Excellent; Mister Sam's blended-heritage character frames the cut at Seagram's-tribute register.",
  "Bone-In Filet|Mocha Creme": "The bone-in filet into the mocha creme -- the marrow-laced butter-tender yields to silky coffee-chocolate cream, espresso depth tying the courses. Strong; the elevated steak earns the layered close at register.",
  "Bone-In Filet|Monkey 47 Gin": "Monkey 47 Gin's botanical-driven lift mis-pairs with the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness -- gin's clean lift reads thin against the cut's weight. The plate deserves Opus One, Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, or Knob Creek 15 Year, not a gin. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Pour the Monkey 47 Gin on another course instead.",
