  "Bone-In Filet|Odette Cabernet Sauvignon": "Odette Cabernet Sauvignon -- Stags Leap Cab, dark fruit, sage, cedar. The structured body wraps the bone-enhanced filet, and the cassis frames the cut. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Bone-In Filet|Old Elk Cigar Cut": "Old Elk Cigar Cut with the bone-in filet — Old Elk Colorado craft against tenderloin-with-bone. Works; Old Elk Cigar Cut frames the cut at cigar-companion register.",
