  "Bone-In Filet|Truffle Fries": "The bone-in filet into the truffle fries -- the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness meets the truffle fries' parmesan-and-truffle fry weight. Excellent; reliable headline side for the steak course.",
  "Bone-In Filet|Tullamore D.E.W.": "Tullamore D.E.W.'s gentle Irish blend sits alongside the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the smooth triple-distilled register matches the bone-enhanced filet, and the orchard-fruit edge underlines the cut. Works; pour is a touch over-specified for this dish.",
