  "Broccoli Cheddar|Blanton's Gold": "Blanton's Gold's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone leans against the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the oak depth lays under the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; the 10-year's oak adds dimension but the match is still gentle.",
  "Broccoli Cheddar|Blanton's Original": "Blanton's Original's soft-oak bourbon body finds neutral with the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; CC 43 Year is over-specified for a side — save the rare bottle for the main course.",
  "Broccoli Cheddar|Blanton's Straight from the Barrel": "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel's soft-oak bourbon body finds neutral with the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon backbone carries the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; Kentucky Owl is over-specified for a side — save the collector bottle for the main.",
  "Broccoli Cheddar|Blood Oath Pact 10": "Blood Oath Pact 10's rounded-oak bourbon character finds neutral with the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon weight handles the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; distinctive character gives the dessert a unique story-frame.",
