  "Broccoli Cheddar|Les Pallières Raciné": "Les Pallières Raciné's deep dark-fruit and grippy tannin finds neutral with the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the structured body wraps the broccoli cheddar, and the cassis frames the bowl. Works; the close composes without strain.",
