  "Broccolini|Licor 43": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- a sweet liqueur on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a digestif. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Licor 43 lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Broccolini|Limoncello": "Limoncello's sweet liqueur character clashes with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- sugar on a clean vegetable side is wrong direction — needs herb-acid lift, not sweetness. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a digestif. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Limoncello lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Broccolini|Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir": "Willamette Pinot — dark cherry, forest floor, refined structure, low tannin. The low-tannin silk lifts broccolini's tender-stem structure and the forest-floor earth plays against the vegetal char. Peaks from the dish's side; on this wine's card it's strong — below peaks with duck, lamb, and mushroom-sauced proteins. Confident pour when a guest anchors on Broccolini. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
