  "Broccolini|Yellow Chartreuse": "Yellow Chartreuse's bitter-herb aperitivo edge clashes with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- bitter aperitivo on the supporting side reads as wrong register for the course. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Yellow Chartreuse belongs on the steak course.",
