  "Brussels and Belly|Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé": "Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé's citrus-mineral acidity reads alongside the maple-glazed Brussels and pork belly — the crisp acidity sits with the plate, and the citrus cuts the rich char. Works; the call holds at register.",
