  "Brussels and Belly|Pommery Cuvée Louise": "Pommery Cuvée Louise's mineral-prestige acidity plays cleanly against the maple-glazed Brussels and pork belly — the mousse-and-acid sits with the plate, and the mineral edge frames the green plate. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Porterhouse": "Porterhouse with Brussels + Belly -- the 40oz dual strip-and-filet meets the maple-pork-belly glaze, the strip side carrying the savory and the filet side meeting the sweet. Strong; the dual cut's range matches the side's range.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Quilt Cabernet Sauvignon": "Napa Cab — ripe blackberry, dark chocolate, toasted vanilla. The lush body handles pork-belly fat and the chocolate-vanilla plays against charred brussels. Strong polished Napa Cab for Brussels and Belly — crowd-pleasing lushness cuts through the rich starter.",
