  "Brussels and Belly|Raventós Cava de NIT Rosé Brut": "Raventós Cava de NIT Rosé Brut's crisp brine-mineral acidity leans against the maple-glazed Brussels and pork belly — the mousse-and-acid sits with the plate, and the cherry-fruit frames the umami depth. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
