  "Brussels and Belly|Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve": "Brussels and Belly: maple-glazed Brussels and pork belly meet George Remus MGP 15yr. Works; Remus 15's rye-spice meets the glaze at Gatsby-tribute register.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Remy VSOP Cognac": "Remy VSOP Cognac's VSOP fine-champagne cognac sits alongside Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the Limousin-oak weight handles the pork-belly plate, and the caramel rounds the side. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
