  "Brussels and Belly|Scotto Cellars The Lost Chapters": "California Cab by-the-glass — black cherry, cassis, dark chocolate, integrated medium tannin. The medium tannin cuts pork-belly fat and the dark chocolate plays against charred brussels. Strong by-the-glass Cab for Brussels and Belly — accessible California value on the rich starter.",
