  "Brussels and Belly|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "The tuna alongside Brussels + Belly -- the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust meets Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts cleanly. Strong; the pairing lands at register without strain against the main.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "The curry opens the meal, Brussels + Belly with the entree -- the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth sets up cleanly for Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts. Strong; the build reads thoughtful across the courses.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Venge Family Reserve": "Brussels and Belly: the Brussels and Belly's smoky, sweet pork richness over bitter-char sprouts meets this structured red's cassis-and-dark-fruit frame, firm tannin, and oak-driven weight. The bold red's dark-fruit weight locks into the side's fat and umami; tannin cleans the dairy. A strong, texturally cohesive match. Strong; reliable across the meal.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Venge Scout's Honor": "Brussels and Belly: the Brussels and Belly's smoky, sweet pork richness over bitter-char sprouts meets this structured red's cassis-and-dark-fruit frame, firm tannin, and oak-driven weight. The bold red's dark-fruit weight locks into the side's fat and umami; tannin cleans the dairy. A strong, texturally cohesive match. Strong; consistent recommendation across the table.",
  "Brussels and Belly|Venge Silencieux": "Kirk Venge single-vineyard Napa — dark cherry, cassis, chocolate, floral violet, silky soft tannin. The silky tannin cuts pork-belly fat and the chocolate plays against charred brussels. Strong winemaker's Napa Cab for Brussels and Belly — Venge precision cuts through the rich starter.",
