  "Butternut Squash|Basil Hayden's Malted Rye": "Basil Hayden's Malted Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the rye-and-oak weight handles the squash bisque, and the oak softens the cream. Works; Portwood is over-specified for sides.",
