  "Butternut Squash|Beefeater Gin": "Beefeater Gin's herbal-botanical edge reads alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the floral edge frames the squash bisque, and the juniper threads the bowl. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
