  "Butternut Squash|Bowdie's Private Select — Maker's Mark": "Bowdie's Private Select — Maker's Mark's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight finds neutral with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the caramel-spice register matches the squash bisque, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; IW Harper 15 frames the two-cut plate at aged-KY-heritage register.",
  "Butternut Squash|Bowman Brothers Small Batch": "Bowman Brothers Small Batch's soft-oak bourbon body sits alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the oak depth lays under the squash bisque, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; Fortuna's NZ terroir meets the glaze at distinctive register.",
  "Butternut Squash|Bowmore 12": "Bowmore 12's lighter-Islay peat character finds neutral with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the scotch depth settles into the squash bisque, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; Old Fitz 9 brings more depth here.",
