  "Butternut Squash|Casa LBV Port": "Casa LBV Port's dessert-wine sweetness clashes with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- the soup-salad course needs acid, not dessert sugar. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a dessert wine. Avoid; one of those is the move. Casa LBV Port belongs on the steak course.",
  "Butternut Squash|Casamigos Mezcal": "Casamigos Mezcal's smoky agave character clashes with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- mezcal smoke fights the soup's cream — smoke has no bridge into dairy delicacy. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a mezcal. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Save the Casamigos Mezcal for the steak course.",
  "Butternut Squash|Caymus Cabernet Sauvignon": "Napa Rutherford Cab against a caramelized-squash autumn soup — concentrated cocoa-mocha body crushes the sweet-cream classic. Never pair. Route Caymus to the steak course and take butternut squash with Riesling, Chardonnay, or Pinot Noir.",
  "Butternut Squash|Chambord": "Chambord's sweet liqueur character overwhelms the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- the liqueur's sweetness buries the soup's creamy base instead of supporting it. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a digestif. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Pour the Chambord on the steak course instead.",
