  "Butternut Squash|Chilean Seabass": "Chilean Seabass after the butternut squash -- the silky sweet squash cream opens with autumnal warmth, the seabass following with buttery pan-finished flesh that the squash's sweetness primes for the richness to land on. Strong; sweet cream sets up the buttery main.",
