  "Butternut Squash|Elk Cove Pinot Blanc": "Willamette Pinot Blanc — delicate Oregon white, stone-fruit, crisp. The stone-fruit plays against butternut's caramelized-squash sweetness and the crisp acid cuts the cream base. Works as Pinot Blanc for butternut squash — Oregon white on the autumn classic.",
