  "Butternut Squash|Kahlua": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- sugar piled onto cream is dessert-course energy on a savory plate — no contrast. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a digestif. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Kahlua for the steak course.",
