  "Butternut Squash|Laurent Perrier Brut Rosé": "Laurent Perrier Brut Rosé's crisp berry-cherry acidity plays cleanly against the squash soup's silky sweet — the mousse refreshes against the broth, and the cherry-fruit rounds the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
