  "Butternut Squash|Louis XIII Cognac": "Louis XIII Cognac's luxury-icon cognac depth mis-pairs with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- an icon cognac on a soup-salad course is wrong moment — its register demands the close, not the open. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not an icon cognac. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Louis XIII Cognac belongs on the steak course.",
