  "Captain Morgan Rum|Broccolini": "Captain Morgan Rum's light-rum register with cane and citrus lift mis-pairs with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- light spirit needs the cut, not the supporting plate. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a light spirit. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Captain Morgan Rum lands on the steak course — not here.",
