  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Durango": "Clase Azul Durango with carrot cake — hand-painted ceramic against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; Durango-ceremony extra añejo meets the cake at luxury register.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Gold": "Clase Azul Gold with carrot cake — 24K gold ceremonial blend against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; blend character meets the cake at luxury-ceremony register.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal": "Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal's earthen-pit smoke profile sits alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the smoky agave register handles the carrot cake, and the wood-smoke note underlines the dessert. Works; the dessert sits cleanly against the meal's register.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Plata": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a light spirit. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Reserve the Clase Azul Plata for the steak course.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Reposado": "Clase Azul Reposado's ceramic-icon reposado character sits alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the barrel-rested body handles the carrot cake, and the cooked-agave note underlines the dessert. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clase Azul Ultra": "Clase Azul Ultra with carrot cake — 5-year platinum-gold ceramic against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; top-tier Ultra meets the cake at absolute-luxury register.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clermont Steep": "Clermont Steep with carrot cake — Jim Beam wheated against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; wheat caramel and cake spice at matched registers.",
  "Carrot Cake|Clos Petit Ona Grenache": "Clos Petit Ona Grenache's spice-and-dark-fruit Rhone register clashes with the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- red structure flattens the spice cake's cinnamon-and-cream-cheese delicacy. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not an elegant red. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Clos Petit Ona Grenache for the steak course.",
  "Carrot Cake|Codigo 1530 Rosa": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's barrel-aged tequila weight finds neutral with the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the aged-agave weight wraps the carrot cake, and the oak threads the dessert. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Carrot Cake|Contratto Vermouth": "Carrot Cake: cream cheese and cinnamon meet Contratto Vermouth. Works; aromatized-wine-botanicals amplify cake spice at aperitivo register — sweeter pairing than the high-proof siblings.",
  "Carrot Cake|Corazon Blanco": "Corazon Blanco's unaged blanco-tequila lift with agave-citrus snap falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a light spirit. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Pour the Corazon Blanco on the steak course instead.",
  "Carrot Cake|Corazon Reposado": "Corazon Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register reads alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the barrel-rested body handles the carrot cake, and the oak threads the dessert. Works; composed but not a standout.",
