  "Carrot Cake|Kansas City": "The KC into the carrot cake -- the savory grain hands off to spiced cake and cream-cheese frosting, walnut crunch on the close. Works; the spice and the strip find each other across the meal arc.",
  "Carrot Cake|Keenan Chardonnay": "Keenan Chardonnay's oaked Spring Mountain Chardonnay clashes with the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- a dry white belongs with the main course, not the dessert close. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a white wine. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Hold the Keenan Chardonnay for the steak course.",
