  "Carrot Cake|Lagavulin 8": "Lagavulin 8's younger-Islay peat character leans against the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the scotch depth settles into the carrot cake, and the heather brightens the dessert. Works; the pairing is pleasant but not a standout.",
