  "Carrot Cake|Lalo Silver": "Lalo Silver's unaged blanco-tequila lift with agave-citrus snap falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a light spirit. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Reserve the Lalo Silver for the steak course.",
