  "Carrot Cake|Monkey Shoulder": "Carrot Cake: cream cheese and cinnamon meet triple-Speyside-malt blend. Monkey Shoulder's Speyside-malt dried-fruit-and-vanilla is the featured blended-Scotch-carrot-cake pairing — the Speyside-malt component brings what Dewar's White's honey-vanilla and JW Red's smoke can't. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
