  "Carrot Cake|Negroni": "Gin, Contratto vermouth, Campari — equal parts, spirit-forward. The Campari bitterness clashes with cream-cheese frosting; the cocktail's weight is wrong for a spiced dessert. Keep Negroni for mushrooms, marrow, or as a pre-dinner opener. Avoid; the pairing fights at the table — point the guest elsewhere.",
