  "Cheesecake|Old Emmer": "Old Emmer with cheesecake — wheated bourbon against custard. Strong; Old Emmer's wheated softness threads the cheesecake at craft register.",
  "Cheesecake|Old Fitzgerald 7 Year": "Old Fitzgerald 7 Year with cheesecake — 100-proof wheated against custard. Works; bonded weight a touch ambitious for the dessert.",
