  "Chilean Seabass|Los Vecinos Mezcal": "Los Vecinos Mezcal's smoky agave character clashes with the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- mezcal smoke and the fish's natural oils refuse to meet cleanly. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a mezcal. Avoid; the better calls are above. Hold the Los Vecinos Mezcal for the steak course.",
