  "Chocolate Brownie|Detroit City Gin": "Detroit City Gin's Detroit urban-craft gin clashes with the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight -- gin botanicals jar against the chocolate's sweetness with no bridge. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Louis XIII Cognac, not a gin. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Pour the Detroit City Gin on the steak course instead.",
