  "Chocolate Brownie|Dewar's White Label": "Dewar's White Label's Highland-scotch character leans against the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight: the scotch depth settles into the brownie, and the malt edge frames the dessert. Works; Boss Hog's allocation story is wasted on the salad.",
