  "Chocolate Brownie|Doctor Bird Jamaica Rum": "Doctor Bird Jamaica Rum: pot-still Jamaican rum with intense hogo funk and high-ester tropical-fruit overdrive. Excellent on brownie; the Jamaican funk meets warm chocolate with tropical-fruit intensity — Doctor Bird is the dark-rum answer for bourbon drinkers wanting something wild.",
