  "Chocolate Brownie|Don Julio Reposado": "Don Julio Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight: the añejo register carries the brownie, and the oak threads the dessert. Works; covers both cuts without standing out.",
