  "Chocolate Cake|Casa LBV Port": "Late Bottled Vintage Port — Casa LBV, 4-6 year cask, dark cherry, plum, smooth moderate structure. The dark cherry wraps fudgy chocolate-cake crumb and the smooth structure handles buttermilk-dairy depth. Strong LBV for chocolate cake — Vintage Port's structured intensity fits cocoa-on-cocoa harder.",
