  "Chocolate Cake|Schloss Vollrads Riesling": "Schloss Vollrads Riesling's crisp apricot-floral acidity holds with the cake's layered chocolate — the dry white underclubs the dessert sugar, and the mineral edge lifts the dish. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
