  "Château Batailley|Mushrooms": "Pauillac 5ème Cru Classé Bordeaux — blackcurrant, tobacco, cedar, graphite, firm tannin. The graphite-earth echoes roasted-mushroom glutamate and the cedar plays against the earth depth. Peak classified Bordeaux for mushrooms — French Pauillac structure on the mushroom side. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
