  "Clam Chowder|Don Julio Reposado": "Don Julio Reposado's cooked-agave-and-oak register finds neutral with the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the barrel-rested body handles the chowder, and the oak threads the bowl. Works; the smoothness doesn't drive the pairing but the theatrics do.",
