  "Clam Chowder|Elk Cove Pinot Blanc": "Willamette Pinot Blanc — delicate Oregon white, stone-fruit, crisp. The crisp acid cuts the chowder's cream weight and the clean profile plays against the clam brine. Peak Pinot Blanc for clam chowder — Oregon white on the shellfish-cream classic. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
