  "Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal's smoky agave character clashes with the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth -- mezcal smoke is wrong register for the soup-salad course. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Le Garenne Rosé, not a mezcal. Avoid; one of those is the move. Pour the Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal on the steak course instead.",
  "Clase Azul Plata|Asparagus": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation sits alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the bright agave-citrus weight carries the asparagus, and the green-agave edge brightens the side. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Clase Azul Plata|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation reads alongside the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the bright agave-citrus weight carries the au gratin, and the green-agave edge brightens the side. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Clase Azul Plata|Beignets": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a light spirit. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Clase Azul Plata belongs on the steak course.",
