  "Clase Azul Plata|Broccolini": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation finds neutral with the broccolini's tender green stalks: the blanco-tequila body matches the broccolini, and the lime-and-pepper thread softens the side. Works; premium craft composes cleanly.",
  "Clase Azul Plata|Brussels and Belly": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation sits alongside Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the blanco-tequila body matches the pork-belly plate, and the lime-and-pepper thread softens the side. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
