  "Clase Azul Plata|Cowboy Ribeye": "Clase Azul Plata's silky Jalisco blanco with ceramic-decanter presentation underclubs the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness -- light spirit lands short of any prime cut. The plate deserves Macallan 18, Caymus Cabernet Sauvignon, or Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon, not a light spirit. Avoid; one of those is the move. Clase Azul Plata belongs on another course.",
