  "Clase Azul Reposado|Filet Mignon": "Clase Azul Reposado with the filet — ultra-premium hand-painted ceramic against the 10oz cut. The Clase Azul smoothness gives the filet a ceremonial frame. This isn't everyday — pour when the table wants the experience and the presentation. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
