  "Clase Azul Reposado|Swordfish": "Clase Azul Reposado's ceramic-icon reposado character sits alongside the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak: the aged-agave weight wraps the swordfish, and the vanilla-and-pepper edge frames the plate. Works; the wine-cask character adds interest but isn't a standout.",
  "Clase Azul Reposado|The Tomahawk": "Clase Azul Reposado's ceramic-icon reposado character underclubs the Tomahawk's theatrical bone-in marbling and smoky char -- this expression lands short of the cut's register. The plate deserves Corazon Stagg, Opus One, or George T. Stagg, not an añejo tequila. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Hold the Clase Azul Reposado for another course.",
