  "Clase Azul Ultra|Bone-In Filet": "Clase Azul Ultra with the bone-in filet — top-tier 5-year Clase Azul against bone-in cut. The Ultra's extended aging and platinum-gold ceramic create the most ceremonial extra-añejo pairing on the menu. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
