  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Escargot": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's crisp agave-floral character finds register with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the añejo depth cuts the umami fat, and the oak frames the umami. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Faroe Island Salmon": "Codigo 1530 Rosa with the salmon — Napa Cabernet-aged reposado against salmon richness. The red-wine fruit influence gives the salmon a wine-logic frame; arguably the best Rosa-reposado salmon pairing because of the Napa influence. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Filet Mignon": "Codigo 1530 Rosa with the filet — Napa Cab-cask-aged reposado against the 10oz cut. The red-wine fruit influence gives the filet a wine-and-tequila bridge distinct from anything else on the menu. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|French Onion": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's cooked-agave-and-oak register sits alongside the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the rested-agave depth sits with the French onion, and the oak threads the bowl. Works; accessible character doesn't drive.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Grilled Caesar": "Codigo 1530 Rosa with the grilled Caesar — Napa Cab-cask rosé against charred romaine. Strong; the wine-cask character earns the Caesar distinctively.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Gumbo": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's rested-agave body leans against the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the gumbo, and the caramel-agave register brightens the bowl. Works; Durango ceremony over-specified for small plate.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Codigo 1530 Rosa's barrel-aged tequila weight sits alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the rested-agave depth sits with the honey carrots, and the vanilla-and-pepper edge frames the side. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|House Wedge": "Codigo 1530 Rosa with the House Wedge — Cabernet-cask reposado against iceberg and bleu. The wine-cask fruit cuts the bleu with berry-driven logic. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Codigo 1530 Rosa|Kansas City": "Codigo 1530 Rosa with the KC — reposado aged in uncharred Napa Cabernet wine barrels. Pink hue from Cabernet-cask influence; red-wine fruit meets agave. Distinct from Komos Rosa's French-oak approach — Codigo leans more directly into the Napa Cab character. A wine-country strip pour. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
