  "Corazon Blanco|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Corazon Blanco's green-agave-and-cane lift reads alongside the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the silver-spirit register lifts the au gratin, and the lime-and-pepper thread softens the side. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Corazon Blanco|Beignets": "Corazon Blanco's unaged blanco-tequila lift with agave-citrus snap falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a light spirit. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Corazon Blanco for the steak course.",
  "Corazon Blanco|Bone Marrow": "Corazon Blanco with bone marrow — highland-agave against umami fat. Avoid; marrow overwhelms blanco.",
  "Corazon Blanco|Bone-In Filet": "Corazon Blanco's green-agave-and-cane lift leans against the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the bright agave-citrus weight carries the bone-enhanced filet, and the unaged-cane note plays against the cut. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
