  "Creamy Potato|New York Sour": "New York Sour's spirit-forward cocktail register clashes with the potato soup's silky-bodied cream -- soup-salad course needs lift — bitters-and-whiskey brings weight instead. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a spirit-forward cocktail. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. New York Sour lands on the steak course — not here.",
