  "Creamy Potato|RAEN Royal St Robert": "RAEN Royal St Robert's cherry-mineral tannin reads alongside the potato soup's silky body — the medium-body red meets the light soup, and the mineral edge cuts the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
