  "Creme Brulee|Elijah Craig Private Barrel": "Elijah Craig Private Barrel's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the brulee, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; annual-release covers both cuts without standing out.",
