  "Creme Brulee|Monkey Shoulder": "Monkey Shoulder's blended Speyside softness reads alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the scotch depth settles into the brulee, and the oak softens the cream. Works; the Millennium's register overshoots the dessert's.",
  "Creme Brulee|Montenegro Amaro": "Montenegro with creme brulee — Bologna vanilla-orange amaro against vanilla custard. The vanilla-vanilla echo is direct; approachable post-dessert pairing. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Creme Brulee|Mount Gay Rum": "Mount Gay Rum's unaged light-rum body reads alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the silver-rum body cuts the brulee, and the unaged-cane register underlines the dessert. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
