  "Darioush Cabernet Franc|Mushrooms": "Mushrooms: the structured red's cassis-and-dark-fruit anchors the mushroom's umami weight; firm tannin and oak hold their register. A headliner pair — pour confidently. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
