  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|Seasonal Vegetables": "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth clashes with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate -- tannin on raw green vegetable reads astringent without payoff. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, not an elegant red. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|Shrimp Bisque": "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon's bold coffee-mocha cassis holds with the bisque's creamy shellfish soup — the concentrated body matches the heavy soup, and the coffee threads the cream. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|Shrimp Cocktail": "Darioush Silverado Trail Cab against chilled sweet-briny shrimp — plush mocha-spice is the wrong axis for cold shellfish and cocktail sauce. Never layer. Route shrimp cocktail to Champagne, Sancerre, or Chablis and save Darioush for steak where its Persian-inspired plush character belongs.",
  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|Swordfish": "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth overshadows the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- dark-fruit weight crowds the seared sesame crust — needs a sparkling or crisp white for lift. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not an elegant red. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|The Tomahawk": "Silverado Trail Cab — blackcurrant, dark plum, mocha, spice, rich plush finish. The opulent body meets Tomahawk fat and char directly and the mocha-spice frames the theatrical bone-in cut. Peak opulent Napa Cab for Tomahawk — Persian-inspired estate story plus plush structure for the biggest marbled steak. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
