  "Darioush Cabernet Sauvignon|Truffle Fries": "Darioush — Silverado Trail Cab with blackcurrant, dark plum, mocha, spice. The opulent body frames truffle-fry earth and the mocha-spice cuts the crisp oil-and-salt. Peak opulent Napa Cab for truffle fries — Persian-inspired estate story meets the decadent side with plush concentration. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
