  "Detroit City Gin|Brussels and Belly": "Detroit City Gin's Detroit urban-craft gin finds neutral with Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the city-distilled juniper frames the pork-belly plate, and the local-spirit character meets the side. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Detroit City Gin|Burrata": "Detroit City Gin with burrata — Detroit City Distillery urban craft, juniper-forward American interpretation. Excellent; Detroit City is the hometown-Detroit burrata pairing — sibling to Detroit City Vodka on the spirits program, parallel to 2 James as the Detroit gin answer.",
