  "Detroit City Gin|Chilean Seabass": "Detroit City Gin's bold char-juniper botanicals lifts the seabass's buttery flesh — the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly, and the spice meets the herb butter. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
