  "Detroit City Gin|Creme Brulee": "Detroit City Gin's Detroit urban-craft gin jars against the brulee's burnt-sugar custard -- sharp botanicals cut through dairy custard without resolving — the dessert reads broken. The plate deserves Sauternes Glass, Vin Santo, or Ron Zacapa Rum, not a gin. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Hold the Detroit City Gin for the steak course.",
