  "Detroit City Gin|Grilled Caesar": "Detroit City Gin with the grilled Caesar — urban craft juniper against charred romaine and anchovy. Works; Detroit City meets the char at hometown register; Knickerbocker's hop-influenced profile is the distinctive Local MI Gin-Caesar match.",
  "Detroit City Gin|Gumbo": "Detroit City Gin's bold char-juniper botanicals leans against the gumbo's spiced Creole stew — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the spice frames the umami depth. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
