  "Detroit City Gin|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Detroit City Gin's bold char-juniper botanicals stays alongside the chickpea soup's roasted-pepper warmth — the gin botanicals sit with the plate. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
  "Detroit City Gin|Salt-Cured Halibut": "Detroit City Gin -- Detroit Distillery, hometown craft, urban juniper. The city-distilled juniper frames the halibut, and the local-spirit character meets the plate. Strong; Neptunia's briny character engages the bleu with distinctive maritime profile.",
