  "Detroit City Vodka|Beignets": "Detroit City Vodka's hometown craft vodka falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a vodka. Avoid; the better calls are above. Detroit City Vodka lands on the steak course — not here.",
