  "Detroit City Vodka|Carrot Cake": "Detroit City Vodka's hometown craft vodka falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a vodka. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Reserve the Detroit City Vodka for the steak course.",
