  "Detroit City Vodka|Chocolate Brownie": "Detroit City Vodka's hometown craft vodka falls short of the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Louis XIII Cognac, not a vodka. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Reserve the Detroit City Vodka for the steak course.",
  "Detroit City Vodka|Chocolate Cake": "Detroit City Vodka's hometown craft vodka falls short of the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body -- vodka brings no flavor to bridge the chocolate's weight — neutral but wrong for the close. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Baileys Irish Cream, not a vodka. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Detroit City Vodka belongs on the steak course.",
