  "Detroit City Vodka|Cowboy Ribeye": "Detroit City Vodka's hometown craft vodka underclubs the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness -- vodka is neutral by design — the marbled char deserves a pour with character. The plate deserves Macallan 18, Caymus Cabernet Sauvignon, or Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon, not a vodka. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Detroit City Vodka lands on another course — not here.",
  "Detroit City Vodka|Crab Cake": "Crab Cake: delicate lump crab meets Detroit City Distillery, Michigan-craft hometown vodka. Detroit City is the local-pride pairing for delicate seafood — parallel to 2 James Gin in the gin category, the Michigan answer when a guest wants something local and story-driven. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
