  "Dewar's 15|Broccoli Cheddar": "Dewar's 15's 15yr aged Highland blend leans against the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the scotch depth settles into the broccoli cheddar, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; boutique covers both cuts without standing out.",
  "Dewar's 15|Broccolini": "Dewar's 15's Highland-scotch character leans against the broccolini's tender green stalks: the heather-and-honey weight sits with the broccolini, and the malt-driven sweetness softens the side. Works; IW Harper 15 is over-specified for an app; save for the main.",
  "Dewar's 15|Brussels and Belly": "Brussels and Belly: maple-glazed Brussels and pork belly meet 15yr Dewar's. Strong; Dewar's 15's sherry-finish dried-fruit meets the glaze at premium-blend register.",
