  "Dewar's 15|Carrot Cake": "Dewar's 15 with carrot cake — aged sherry-finish Dewar's against cream cheese and cinnamon. Excellent; Dewar's 15's sherry-cask dried-fruit is the featured Dewar's-carrot-cake pairing — parallel to Monkey Shoulder's Speyside-malt fruit for the blended-Scotch-carrot-cake lane at aged register.",
  "Dewar's 15|Cheesecake": "Dewar's 15's Highland-scotch character finds neutral with the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the Highland register carries the cheesecake, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; EC 18 handles dessert density at aged-HH register.",
  "Dewar's 15|Chilean Seabass": "Dewar's 15's 15yr aged Highland blend swallows the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a scotch. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Save the Dewar's 15 for the steak course.",
