  "Dewar's 15|Cowboy Ribeye": "Dewar's 15 with the cowboy ribeye — 15yr aged Dewar's against 26oz bone-in cap-fat. Strong; Dewar's 15's aged sherry-finish frames the ribeye at premium-blend register.",
