  "Dewar's 15|Sauteed Garlic Spinach": "Dewar's 15's Highland-scotch character finds neutral with the garlic spinach's garlic-buttered greens: the scotch depth settles into the garlic spinach, and the heather brightens the side. Works; Sinatra Select handles the richness at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Dewar's 15|Seafood Tower": "Dewar's 15's 15yr aged Highland blend overshadows the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- the spirit weight crowds the delicate shellfish — no acid to clean the brine. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a scotch. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Pour the Dewar's 15 on the steak course instead.",
  "Dewar's 15|Seared Scallops": "Dewar's 15 with seared scallops — sherry-finish Highland blend against scallop delicacy. Avoid; Scotch overwhelms scallops.",
  "Dewar's 15|Seasonal Soup": "Dewar's 15's Highland-scotch character sits alongside the seasonal soup's house seasonal build: the malt-and-oak threads the seasonal soup, and the oak-and-smoke underlines the bowl. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Dewar's 15|Seasonal Vegetables": "Dewar's 15's Highland-scotch character leans against the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the scotch backbone matches the seasonal vegetables, and the honey rounds the side. Works; premium proof overpowers this dish.",
