  "Dewar's 15|Swordfish": "Dewar's 15's 15yr aged Highland blend swallows the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a scotch. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Dewar's 15 lands on the steak course — not here.",
