  "Domaine Tempier Bandol|House Wedge": "Provence Bandol AOC Mourvèdre blend — Tempier, dark plum, game, olive, wild herbs, smoky mineral, firm tannin. The game plays with blue-cheese funk and the smoky mineral matches bacon-char. Works for wedge — cold iceberg mutes Tempier's cult-producer complexity, so a lighter Chianti lifts higher.",
