  "Don Julio Blanco|Beignets": "Don Julio Blanco's workhorse blanco with clean agave snap falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a light spirit. Avoid; the better calls are above. Reserve the Don Julio Blanco for the steak course.",
