  "Don Julio Blanco|Carrot Cake": "Don Julio Blanco's workhorse blanco with clean agave snap falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a light spirit. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Don Julio Blanco lands on the steak course — not here.",
