  "El Mayor Extra Anejo|Swordfish": "El Mayor Extra Anejo's aged-agave character clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- aged tequila is wrong register for a main fish or poultry course. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not an añejo tequila. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. El Mayor Extra Anejo belongs on the steak course.",
