  "El Mayor Reposado|Au Gratin Potatoes": "El Mayor Reposado's barrel-aged tequila weight leans against the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the rested-agave depth sits with the au gratin, and the caramel-agave register brightens the side. Works; the pour is a touch over-specified for the side.",
