  "El Mayor Reposado|Creme Brulee": "El Mayor Reposado's rested-agave body leans against the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the brulee, and the soft-spice note softens the dessert. Works; the cedar is novel but the dish doesn't call for distinctive-wood character.",
