  "El Mayor Reposado|Honey Roasted Carrots": "El Mayor Reposado's añejo-pour depth reads alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the honey carrots, and the soft-spice note softens the side. Works; crystallino-filtered complexity handles richness at trendy-luxury register.",
  "El Mayor Reposado|House Wedge": "El Mayor Reposado with the House Wedge — value agave-forward reposado against iceberg and bleu. The brightness cuts the bleu at the accessible register. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "El Mayor Reposado|Kansas City": "El Mayor Reposado with the KC — value 80-proof reposado, agave-forward with light oak. Approachable everyday pour; less refined than Don Julio's benchmark, less distinctive than Siete Leguas' craft — El Mayor is the dependable value call for strip orders. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
