  "Elephant Gin|Grilled Caesar": "Elephant Gin with the grilled Caesar — craft African-botanical gin against charred romaine and anchovy. Strong; Elephant's herbal profile meets the char; Tanq 10's citrus is still the sharper gin-Caesar.",
