  "Elephant Gin|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Elephant Gin's crisp char-herbal botanicals plays cleanly against the carrots' honeyed sweetness — the botanical edge sits with the light side, and the herbs echo the green plate. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
