  "Elephant Gin|Mocha Creme": "Elephant Gin's botanical-driven lift clashes with the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- gin's botanical-citrus register fights dessert sweetness without a bridge. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not a gin. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Save the Elephant Gin for the steak course.",
