  "Elephant Gin|Seafood Tower": "Elephant Gin with the seafood tower — conservation-charity craft gin against the raw bar. Excellent; Elephant is the story-driven tower pairing — baobab/buchu/lion's tail profile distinctive enough to make the raw bar memorable.",
  "Elephant Gin|Seared Scallops": "Elephant Gin with seared scallops — African-botanical craft gin against scallop sweetness. Excellent; baobab and buchu bring a savanna-herbal lift to scallops that no classic London Dry replicates.",
