  "Elijah Craig 18 Year|Asparagus": "Elijah Craig 18 Year's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight sits alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the caramel-spice register matches the asparagus, and the oak frames the side. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
