  "Elijah Craig Private Barrel|Filet Mignon": "Elijah Craig Private Barrel with the filet — Heaven Hill's house-picked single-barrel. Each barrel varies; the private-selection approach gives the filet a pour specifically chosen for this room. Distinct from Elijah Craig Single Barrel (general release) — private barrel is the curated pick. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
