  "Elk Cove Five Mountain|Creme Brulee": "Elk Cove Five Mountain's silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift flattens the brulee's burnt-sugar custard -- the structured red has nothing to bridge into a dessert finish. The plate deserves Sauternes Glass, Vin Santo, or Ron Zacapa Rum, not an elegant red. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Hold the Elk Cove Five Mountain for the steak course.",
