  "Elk Cove Five Mountain|Grilled Caesar": "Chehalem Mountains Willamette Pinot — cherry, violet, clove. The structured acid cuts anchovy-parmesan dressing and the clove-spice plays against grilled-romaine char. Strong step-up Pinot for grilled Caesar — Chehalem Mountains depth on the layered salad.",
