  "Elk Cove Pinot Blanc|Filet Mignon": "Elk Cove Pinot Blanc — Willamette with pear, peach, floral, medium body. The medium body can handle butter-tender filet's lean sweetness unconventionally; fruit plays against escargot-butter toppers. Works as light-white-with-steak; classic reds peak higher for filet's deeper beef character.",
