  "Elk Cove Pinot Blanc|Grilled Caesar": "Willamette Pinot Blanc — soft pear, white peach, floral, medium body. The refreshing acid cuts anchovy-parmesan dressing and the fruit plays against grilled-romaine char without overpowering. Strong unoaked white for grilled Caesar — sophisticated alternative to the usual Chardonnay pairing.",
