  "Escargot|Basil Hayden's Malted Rye": "Basil Hayden's Malted Rye's crisp char-earth character holds steady against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the caramel-oak depth threads the savory plate, and the spice frames the umami depth. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
