  "Escargot|Bee's Knees": "Empress Indigo gin with lemon and honey lavender syrup. The honey pairs subtly with our escargot's absinthe-finish anise note; the lemon cuts the butter weight. Three ingredients, zero filler — matches the escargot's clean flavor structure. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Escargot|Beefeater Gin": "Beefeater with escargot — 9-botanical London Dry against garlic-butter snails. Excellent; the 24-hour botanical steep gives Beefeater enough depth to match the butter while staying democratic.",
  "Escargot|Beignets": "The escargot and the beignets -- the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight bookends with the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry. Works; no flavor conflict across the meal, either as opener-close or together.",
  "Escargot|Belvedere Vodka": "Belvedere with escargot — aromatic Polish rye against garlic-butter snails. Excellent; Belvedere's pepper cuts butter harder than the wheat-based siblings can, lifting the garlic notes cleanly.",
