  "Escargot|Blanton's Original": "Blanton's Original's soft-oak bourbon body leans against the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the bourbon depth settles into the buttered escargot, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; EHT Full Proof meets the earthy-rich at historic Kentucky register; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
