  "Escargot|Blood Oath Pact 9": "Blood Oath Pact 9's cherry-spice character sits with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the bourbon weight grips the savory plate, and the oak frames the umami. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Escargot|Bluecoat Gin": "Bluecoat with escargot — patriotic-artisan citrus gin against garlic-butter snails. Works; Bluecoat's citrus meets butter with American-craft character; Mahón's Mediterranean juniper cuts it harder.",
