  "Escargot|Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvignon": "Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvignon's bold earth cassis lifts the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the firm tannin cuts the rich starter, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
