  "Escargot|Corazon Weller": "Corazon Weller's barrel-aged tequila weight leans against the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the barrel-rested body handles the buttered escargot, and the oak threads the starter. Strong; modern cleanness is capable but the starter earns a more character-forward reposado.",
  "Escargot|Corazón del Sol Malbec": "Corazón del Sol Malbec's bold floral cassis plays cleanly against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the Cab structure meets the savory depth, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Escargot|Corpse Reviver": "Warner's gin, Lillet, cognac, lemon, absinthe rinse. The anise-edge nose plays directly against garlic-butter escargot and cognac's richness meets the snails' earth. Peak pre-Prohibition cocktail for a classical starter — textbook pairing from another era. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
