  "Escargot|Cowboy Ribeye": "The cowboy ribeye after the escargot -- the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight sets up the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness: umami plays against the protein, the table earns its depth. Works; the starter composes before the cut.",
  "Escargot|Cragganmore 12": "Cragganmore 12 -- Speyside complexity, malt, fruit. The heather-and-honey weight sits with the buttered escargot, and the honey rounds the starter. Strong; the distinctive maturation handles both cuts with character-story behind it; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
  "Escargot|Creamed Spinach": "Escargot alongside the creamed spinach -- the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight meets the creamed spinach's rich bechamel-laced greens: cream meets umami, the table goes deep. Works; no conflict, the meal builds.",
  "Escargot|Creamy Potato": "Escargot and the potato soup together -- cream meets umami, the table goes deep. Works; the table opens with both, no clash either way.",
