  "Escargot|Dewar's White Label": "Dewar's White Label's crisp honey-vanilla character matches the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the caramel-oak depth threads the savory plate, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Escargot|Disaronno": "Disaronno's sweet liqueur character clashes with the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight -- sweet liqueur is dessert energy — wrong place for the table's first course. The plate deserves Green Chartreuse, Mata Hari Absinthe, or Daniel Chotard Sancerre Rouge, not a digestif. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Hold the Disaronno for the steak course.",
  "Escargot|Doc Swinson's Alter Ego Rye": "Doc Swinson's Alter Ego Rye's herbal-spice character lifts the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the bourbon weight grips the savory plate, and the herbs play the buttery edge. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
