  "Escargot|Domaine Tempier Bandol": "Domaine Tempier Bandol's bold earth-mineral cassis holds steady against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the Cab structure meets the savory depth. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Escargot|Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé": "Pouilly-Fumé's flinty Loire Sauvignon Blanc — a smokier profile than Sancerre. Handles the escargot butter's herb-and-garlic complexity and hooks into the absinthe-finish's subtle anise note. The smoke character gives it an edge over cleaner Loire whites here. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
