  "Escargot|Ghost Block Cabernet Sauvignon": "Ghost Block Cabernet Sauvignon's bold cherry-oak cassis reads alongside the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the firm tannin cuts the rich starter, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
  "Escargot|Ghost Block Zinfandel": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's bold pepper-spice cassis holds steady against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the Cab structure meets the savory depth, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
