  "Escargot|Laurent Perrier Brut Rosé": "Escargot: this rich, umami-forward starter's bold fat and concentrated savory depth meets this sparkling rosé's strawberry-and-brioche charm with crisp acidity. Sparkling's bubbles and acid scrub the starter's fat while the bright frame lifts the plate. Strong — palate-cleansing start.",
  "Escargot|Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut": "Tours-sur-Marne Chardonnay-blend Champagne — precise refinement with green apple, lemon zest, whisper of brioche. The vibrant acidity cuts escargot's garlic-parsley butter weight and the brioche complements the French classic. Peak Champagne for escargot — both wine and dish from the same tradition. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
