  "Escargot|Louis XIII Cognac": "Louis XIII Cognac's luxury-icon cognac depth mis-pairs with the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight -- a luxury cognac is wrong moment for the opener — save it for after the meal. The plate deserves Green Chartreuse, Mata Hari Absinthe, or Daniel Chotard Sancerre Rouge, not an icon cognac. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Louis XIII Cognac lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Escargot|Lucano Amaro": "Lucano Amaro's bitter-herb aperitivo edge doubles down on the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight -- aperitivo herbs and a herb-bright opener compound the bitter register — no contrast. The plate deserves Green Chartreuse, Mata Hari Absinthe, or Daniel Chotard Sancerre Rouge, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Pour the Lucano Amaro on the steak course instead.",
