  "Escargot|Macauley Stagecoach Vineyard": "Macauley Stagecoach Vineyard's bold coffee cassis sits with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the Cab structure meets the savory depth, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Escargot|Mahon Gin": "Escargot: garlic-butter snails meet PDO juniper-heavy Mediterranean gin. Mahón's Spanish dry-juniper profile cuts butter with Mediterranean sharpness — the featured Botanical-Forward Craft Gin escargot pairing, parallel to Tanqueray's flagship juniper approach from the London Dry cluster. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Escargot|Maker's Mark": "Maker's Mark -- wheated, red-rope, caramel. The wheated softness matches the buttered escargot, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; composed namesake match; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
