  "Escargot|Michter's 10 Year Bourbon": "Michter's 10 Year Bourbon's rounded-oak bourbon character sits alongside the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the bourbon depth settles into the buttered escargot, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; boutique-blend sits with richness; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
  "Escargot|Michter's 10 Year Rye": "Michter's 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character reads register-aligned with the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the rye spice cuts the buttered escargot, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Strong; craft-blend narrative covers the cut with KO authority; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
