  "Escargot|Roast Half Chicken": "The chicken and the escargot across courses -- the herb-butter chicken meets the buttered escargot. Strong; the opener carries its register before the main.",
  "Escargot|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "The escargot preceded by the chickpea soup -- separate registers share the plate, the contrast settles the build. Works; safe opening pair, the meal builds without strain.",
  "Escargot|Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs": "Le Mesnil Grand Cru Chardonnay — chalky minerality, lemon curd, green apple, no dosage. The austere precision cuts escargot's garlic-parsley butter and the chalk-mineral echoes French terroir tradition directly. Peak sommelier Champagne for escargot — technical match from the same soil. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Escargot|Roku Gin": "Roku with escargot — sansho-pepper Suntory Japanese gin against garlic-butter snails. Strong; Roku's sansho adds distinctive Japanese-pepper lift to the butter; Mahón's Mediterranean juniper still cuts butter hardest.",
  "Escargot|Ron Zacapa Rum": "Ron Zacapa Rum's Solera-honey character holds steady against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the light body is outpaced by the savory plate, and the rounded sweetness meets the herb butter. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Escargot|Russell's Reserve 10 Year": "Russell's Reserve 10 Year's caramel-honey character matches the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the aged-oak depth meets the rich starter, and the caramel rounds the umami plate. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
