  "Escargot|Seasonal Vegetables": "The escargot and the seasonal vegetables -- neither course pulls focus, the table reads even. Works; sequence them or share the table, no concern either way.",
  "Escargot|Sesti Brunello di Montalcino": "Sesti Brunello di Montalcino's firm cassis-and-cocoa tannin meets at register with the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the bold Cab register matches the buttered escargot, and the espresso-cocoa note rounds the starter. Strong; reliable opener for the cut.",
  "Escargot|Shafer 1.5": "Shafer 1.5's concentrated dark-fruit and tannin sits alongside the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the structured body wraps the buttered escargot, and the cassis frames the starter. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Escargot|Shafer Hillside Select": "Shafer Hillside Select's bold cassis-tobacco tannin plays cleanly against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the Cab structure meets the savory depth, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
