  "Escargot|Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon": "Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon's bold cassis-oak tannin holds the line with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the firm tannin cuts the rich starter, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
