  "Escargot|Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc": "Marlborough NZ Sauv Blanc — passionfruit, grapefruit, grass, zesty acidity. The zesty acid cuts escargot's garlic-parsley butter and the tropical-citrus plays against the snail richness. Strong accessible NZ Sauv Blanc for escargot — approachable by-the-glass pour on the French classic.",
  "Escargot|Swordfish": "The swordfish and the escargot across courses -- the lemon-bright swordfish holds with the butter-bath starter. Strong; the opener carries its register before the main.",
