  "Escargot|Tenuta di Arceno Chianti Classico": "Tenuta di Arceno Chianti Classico's Sangiovese-driven Tuscan acidity rests at register with the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the high-acid Tuscan register cuts the buttered escargot, and the savory red register plays against the starter. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
