  "Faroe Island Salmon|Jameson Irish Whiskey": "Faroe Island Salmon: oily salmon meets iconic smooth Irish. Jameson's sherry+bourbon-cask triple-distilled character frames fish at crowd-pleasing register — Irish whiskey is one of the few whisky categories that actually handles salmon, and Jameson leads this lane. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Faroe Island Salmon|Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir": "Russian River Pinot — red cherry, pomegranate, subtle earth, balanced acidity, smooth. The food-friendly body plays against salmon's oil-rich flesh; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Peak reliable Pinot for salmon across most seasonal preparations. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Faroe Island Salmon|Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis": "Burgundy Chablis — unoaked Chard, flint, chalk, lemon, green apple, lean precise. The clean acidity cuts salmon's oil-rich flesh; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Peak unoaked Chardonnay for salmon across most seasonal builds — classical French pairing. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
