  "Faroe Island Salmon|Johnnie Walker Black": "Johnnie Walker Black's Highland-scotch character swallows the salmon's rich oily flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a scotch. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Reserve the Johnnie Walker Black for the steak course.",
