  "Faroe Island Salmon|Schloss Vollrads Riesling": "Schloss Vollrads — Rheingau Riesling with apricot, peach, petrol, lively acid, off-dry. The off-dry fruit cuts salmon's oil-rich flesh; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Strong German Riesling for salmon across most seasonal builds — classical fruit-and-acid match.",
