  "Fernet Menta|Broccolini": "Fernet Menta's crisp mint-menthol edge sits alongside the broccolini's tender green — the bitter herb edge sits with the light side. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Fernet Menta|Brussels and Belly": "Fernet Menta with Brussels + Belly — mint Fernet against maple-glazed pork belly. Works; the mint cools the glaze, though Branca cuts it harder.",
  "Fernet Menta|Burrata": "Fernet Menta with burrata — Fernet against fresh dairy. Avoid; even the softer mint sibling is wrong for burrata's cream.",
  "Fernet Menta|Butternut Squash": "Fernet Menta's crisp mint-menthol edge leans against the squash soup's silky sweet — the bitter herb edge frames the light soup. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Fernet Menta|Carrot Cake": "Fernet Menta with carrot cake — cooling mint Fernet against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; mint threads through spice cleanly.",
  "Fernet Menta|Cheesecake": "Fernet Menta with cheesecake — mint Fernet against custard. Strong; cooling mint is a cleaner finish on cheesecake than Branca's saffron would be.",
  "Fernet Menta|Chilean Seabass": "Fernet Menta's crisp mint-menthol edge plays cleanly against the seabass's buttery flesh — the bitter herb edge cleans the fish. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Fernet Menta|Chocolate Brownie": "Fernet Menta with the chocolate brownie — mint-forward Fernet cousin against cocoa. Excellent; mint and chocolate is the classic pairing, and Menta brings it with Branca's backbone but softer entry. The one amaro where this dessert jumps tier.",
