  "Fernet Menta|Cowboy Ribeye": "Fernet Menta's bitter-herb aperitivo edge finds neutral with the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness: the herbal cut works the cap-fat ribeye, and the amaro backbone frames the cut. Works; the call holds at register.",
