  "Fernet Menta|Creme Brulee": "Fernet Menta with creme brulee — mint bitter against vanilla custard and caramelized sugar. Strong; the mint lift reads cleanly through the caramel.",
  "Fernet Menta|Escargot": "Fernet Menta's bitter-herb aperitivo edge leans against the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the herbal cut works the buttered escargot, and the amaro backbone frames the starter. Strong; Branca cuts the glaze's sweetness harder than sipping amari and makes the side read savory.",
