  "Four Roses Yellow Label|Cowboy Ribeye": "Four Roses Yellow Label with the Cowboy Ribeye — 80-proof entry bourbon against the cut's scale. Underpowered; strong as a choice but the ribeye earns a heavier pour. Strong; consistent recommendation across the table.",
