  "Fox & Oden Double Oaked|Chocolate Brownie": "Chocolate Brownie: warm cocoa meets Fox & Oden is a Detroit-based Black-owned whiskey brand with Double Oaked finish (second char intensifies vanilla, toasted oak, heavy caramel). Fox & Oden Double Oaked's intensified-caramel + cocoa is the featured Double-Oaked-chocolate pairing at distinctive-brand register — the second-char caramel amplifies cocoa with Detroit-brand distinction. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
