  "Fox & Oden Double Oaked|Creme Brulee": "Creme Brulee: vanilla custard and caramelized sugar meet Detroit-brand Double Oaked. Fox & Oden's second-char caramel amplifies the brulee caramel — the featured Double-Oaked-brulee match at distinctive register. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
