  "Freemark Abbey Bosché|House Wedge": "Rutherford Cab — Bosché Vineyard since 1970, blackcurrant, tobacco, graphite, firm tannin. The firm tannin cuts iceberg-and-bacon and the tobacco plays against blue cheese dressing. Works as Bosché Vineyard Cab for the wedge — 1970-legacy Rutherford reframes the salad; whites peak higher.",
