  "Freemark Abbey Bosché|Truffle Fries": "Truffle Fries: the bold red's cassis grip carries the mushroom-and-truffle depth — structured weight on the earthy side. A headliner pair — pour confidently. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Freemark Abbey Bosché|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Freemark Abbey Bosché's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth clashes with the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- tannin reads metallic against the fish's natural fats. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not an elegant red. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Save the Freemark Abbey Bosché for the steak course.",
