  "French Onion|Muga Reserva": "Rioja Alta Reserva Tempranillo-blend — American-French oak, strawberry, dried cherry, vanilla, leather. The vanilla-oak meets French Onion's gruyère-crust richness and the dried cherry plays against the caramelized onion. Strong Rioja for French Onion — Spanish earth on the French classic.",
