  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Bone Marrow": "Garavogue Irish Whiskey's Irish whiskey smoothness sits alongside the bone marrow's unctuous rendered-marrow richness: the gentle Irish body threads the rich marrow, and the triple-distilled smoothness brightens the starter. Strong; aged Beam matches richness cleanly; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
