  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Broccolini": "Garavogue Irish Whiskey's Irish whiskey smoothness reads alongside the broccolini's tender green stalks: the Irish whiskey body sits with the broccolini, and the grain register softens the side. Works; collector-bottle depth gives ultra-premium character.",
