  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Creme Brulee": "Garavogue Irish Whiskey's Irish whiskey smoothness leans against the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the approachable Irish character carries the brulee, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; the toast notes don't really interplay with the soup but don't clash.",
