  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Faroe Island Salmon": "Garavogue with the salmon — Sligo-river-named craft Irish whiskey, western Ireland distinctive small-batch character. Excellent; Garavogue's craft-Irish profile is the featured Irish-salmon pairing — the western-Ireland provenance frames Faroe Island fish with a distinctive north-Atlantic story that Jameson's iconic-entry can't tell as specifically.",
