  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Market Fish": "Garavogue Irish Whiskey's Irish whiskey smoothness swallows the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not an Irish whiskey. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Save the Garavogue Irish Whiskey for the steak course.",
