  "Garavogue Irish Whiskey|Seafood Tower": "Garavogue Irish Whiskey's Irish whiskey smoothness drowns out the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- sweet-oak depth flattens the briny opener instead of lifting it. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not an Irish whiskey. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Hold the Garavogue Irish Whiskey for the steak course.",
