  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Mushroom Bisque": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's bold pepper-spice cassis reads alongside the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the concentrated body matches the heavy soup, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Mushrooms": "Napa Oakville Zinfandel — Ghost Block, ripe jammy fruit, blackberry preserves, cracked pepper, full body, medium tannin. The cracked pepper plays with roasted-mushroom butter-depth, though the jammy fruit reads heavy for earth-glutamate. Strong California-Zin for mushrooms — an old-world Grenache fits earthier.",
  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's jammy Zinfandel with bramble-and-pepper lift clashes with the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge -- savory tannin sits awkwardly on cocoa weight without resolving. The plate deserves Frangelico, Disaronno, or Graham's 20 Year Tawny, not an elegant red. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Hold the Ghost Block Zinfandel for the steak course.",
  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Porterhouse": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's bold pepper-spice cassis holds the line with the porterhouse's two-cut character — the firm-tannin weight matches the rendered fat, and the cassis plays against the grilled char. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Prime Tartare": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's powerful blackcurrant body rests at register with the tartare's raw beef-and-brine umami: the powerful body carries the tartare, and the iron-mineral plays against the starter. Strong; the side composes cleanly with the cut.",
  "Ghost Block Zinfandel|Rainbow Trout": "Ghost Block Zinfandel's jammy Zinfandel with bramble-and-pepper lift clashes with the trout's delicate flesh -- tannin reads metallic against the delicate fish — a crisp white cleans where red sits heavy. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not an elegant red. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Ghost Block Zinfandel lands on the steak course — not here.",
