  "Glenglassaugh 12|Creme Brulee": "Glenglassaugh 12's Highland-scotch character sits alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the heather-and-honey weight sits with the brulee, and the oak threads the cream. Works; light body doesn't overshoot.",
