  "Glenglassaugh 12|Lobster Mac": "Glenglassaugh 12's Highland-scotch character leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the scotch depth settles into the lobster mac, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; gentle match.",
