  "Glenglassaugh 12|Seasonal Vegetables": "Glenglassaugh 12's Highland-scotch character finds neutral with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the scotch depth settles into the seasonal vegetables, and the oak-and-smoke underlines the side. Works; a gentle composed match at the premium tier.",
