  "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port|Gumbo": "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port's structured vintage port with dark-fruit weight clashes with the gumbo's spiced creole stew -- the soup-salad course needs acid, not dessert sugar. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Fattoria Le Pupille Saffredi, or Muga Reserva, not a dessert wine. Avoid; one of those is the move. Graham's 2017 Vintage Port lands on the steak course — not here.",
