  "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port|Kansas City": "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port's structured vintage port with dark-fruit weight clashes with the KC's lean-bold strip with savory grain -- dessert wine belongs after the meal, not alongside the steak. The plate deserves Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, Pio Cesare Barbaresco, or Pappy Van Winkle 13 Year Rye, not a dessert wine. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Save the Graham's 2017 Vintage Port for another course.",
  "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port|Loaded Potato": "Graham's 2017 Vintage Port's structured vintage port with dark-fruit weight clashes with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup -- the soup-salad course needs acid, not dessert sugar. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a dessert wine. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Graham's 2017 Vintage Port lands on the steak course — not here.",
