  "Gran Patron Platinum|Chocolate Cake": "Gran Patron Platinum's silver-spirit lift with agave-citrus edge reads alongside the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the bright agave-citrus weight carries the chocolate cake, and the green-agave edge brightens the dessert. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Clam Chowder": "Gran Patron Platinum's clean silver register sits alongside the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the blanco-tequila body matches the chowder, and the lime-and-pepper thread softens the bowl. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Cowboy Ribeye": "Gran Patron Platinum's unaged silver-spirit body reads alongside the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness: the blanco-tequila body matches the cap-fat ribeye, and the unaged-cane note plays against the cut. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Crab Cake": "Gran Patron Platinum with crab cake — triple-distilled premium Patron in glass crystal. Smooth, concentrated agave; distinct from standard Patron Silver by triple distillation and ultra-premium positioning. The top-tier Patron for lump crab; a glass-bottle luxury pairing. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
