  "Gran Patron Platinum|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Gran Patron Platinum's green-agave-and-cane lift reads alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the silver-spirit register lifts the honey carrots, and the green-agave edge brightens the side. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|House Wedge": "Gran Patron Platinum with the House Wedge — ultra-premium Patron against iceberg and bleu. The smooth concentrated agave cuts the bleu at the premium-Patron register. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Kansas City": "Gran Patron Platinum's agave-citrus character holds the line with the strip's lean char — the light body is outweighed by the cut, and the vanilla softens the grilled char. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Loaded Potato": "Gran Patron Platinum's clean silver register sits alongside the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the blanco-tequila body matches the loaded potato soup, and the unaged-cane note plays against the bowl. Works; clean composes cleanly.",
  "Gran Patron Platinum|Lobster Mac": "Gran Patron Platinum's unaged silver-spirit body leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the silver-spirit register lifts the lobster mac, and the bright blanco register underlines the side. Works; the call holds at register.",
