  "Green Chartreuse|Brussels and Belly": "Green Chartreuse's aperitivo herb-and-bitter cut leans against Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the herbal cut works the pork-belly plate, and the amaro backbone frames the side. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
