  "Green Chartreuse|Cheesecake": "Green Chartreuse: 55% ABV, 130+ herbs/botanicals, Carthusian monks since 1605. Excellent on cheesecake; the powerful herbal-complex-bitter character cuts through cheesecake cream like a knife — the dessert-meets-digestif classic at high-proof register.",
