  "Green Chartreuse|Escargot": "Escargot: garlic-herb butter and snails meet Green Chartreuse. Excellent; the 130-botanical herbal profile ties directly to the herb butter at Carthusian register — the French digestif on the French classic. Gold standard; pour without second-guessing.",
