  "Green Chartreuse|Shrimp Cocktail": "Green Chartreuse's bitter-herb aperitivo edge overwhelms the shrimp cocktail's cool brine-and-citrus shellfish -- bitter aperitivo flattens the opener's lighter register. The plate deserves Bacardi Rum, Grey Goose Vodka, or Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Pour the Green Chartreuse on the steak course instead.",
  "Green Chartreuse|Swordfish": "Green Chartreuse's bitter-herb aperitivo edge clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- bitter botanicals fight the savory sear — bitter against char without resolution. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Reserve the Green Chartreuse for the steak course.",
