  "Grey Goose Vodka|Beignets": "Grey Goose Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a vodka. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Hold the Grey Goose Vodka for the steak course.",
