  "Grey Goose Vodka|Carrot Cake": "Grey Goose Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Vin Santo, Disaronno, or Graham's 10 Year Tawny, not a vodka. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Grey Goose Vodka belongs on the steak course.",
