  "Gumbo|Blanton's Straight from the Barrel": "Blanton's Straight from the Barrel's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight sits alongside the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the brown-spirit warmth threads the gumbo, and the rounded sweetness brightens the bowl. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
