  "Gumbo|Bluecoat Gin": "Bluecoat Gin's coriander-and-juniper register leans against the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the floral edge frames the gumbo, and the juniper threads the bowl. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
  "Gumbo|Bodega Noemia A Lisa": "Bodega Noemia A Lisa's bold earth-floral cassis finds neutral with the gumbo's spiced Creole stew — the opulent body overshoots the light soup, and the cassis grips the umami plate. Works; composed but not a standout.",
