  "Gumbo|Bombay Sapphire Gin": "Bombay Sapphire Gin's crisp London-Dry-citrus botanicals holds with the gumbo's spiced Creole stew — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the citrus brightens the spice. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Gumbo|Bone Marrow": "The bone marrow preceded by the gumbo -- spice plays against rich protein, clean contrast. Works; safe opening pair, the meal builds without strain.",
  "Gumbo|Bone-In Filet": "The bone-in filet after the gumbo -- the gumbo's spiced creole stew sets the table for the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: heat lifts the rich course, the table earns the warmer note. Works; the opener carries before the cut.",
