  "Gumbo|Far Niente Chardonnay": "Oakville Chardonnay against a dark-roux Cajun stew — opulent oak-butter has no hook into gumbo's smoky-spicy depth. Never pair. Route Far Niente to salmon, lobster mac, scallops, or the bisque course; take gumbo with Rioja, CdP, Super Tuscan, or Zinfandel.",
