  "Gumbo|Fattoria Le Pupille Saffredi": "Super Tuscan — Maremma Cab-Merlot-Petit Verdot, blackcurrant, tobacco, graphite, Mediterranean herbs, firm-tannin finish. The firm tannin cuts gumbo's dark-roux fat and the herbs play against Cajun bay-and-file spice. Peak Super Tuscan for gumbo — Mediterranean herbal structure meets the stew's complexity. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
