  "HDW 100 Vodka|Market Fish": "HDW 100 with the market fish — 100-proof craft vodka against featured fish. Works; HDW 100's extra ABV handles fish with distinctive backbone.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|Mocha Creme": "HDW 100 Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not a vodka. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Save the HDW 100 Vodka for the steak course.",
