  "HDW 100 Vodka|Peanut Butter Brownie": "HDW 100 Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge -- vodka brings no flavor to bridge the chocolate's weight — neutral but wrong for the close. The plate deserves Frangelico, Disaronno, or Graham's 20 Year Tawny, not a vodka. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. HDW 100 Vodka belongs on the steak course.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|Porterhouse": "HDW 100 Vodka's crystalline neutrality underclubs the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character -- vodka is too neutral to carry any prime cut. The plate deserves Odette Cabernet Sauvignon, Weller 12 Year, or Domaine du Grand Tinel, not a vodka. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. HDW 100 Vodka belongs on another course.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|Prime Tartare": "HDW 100 with the tartare — 100-proof craft vodka (50% ABV) with higher backbone than standard 80-proof vodkas. Excellent; HDW 100's extra proof and herbal lift are the featured craft-vodka-tartare pairing — where Detroit City sits with the tartare and Hangar 1 floralizes it, HDW 100 lifts it hard.",
