  "HDW 100 Vodka|Sauteed Garlic Spinach": "HDW 100 Vodka's char-herbal neutrality reads alongside the garlic-spinach's buttered greens — the neutral profile sits with the light side, and the herbs play the buttery edge. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|Seafood Tower": "HDW 100 Vodka's char-herbal neutrality holds steady against the tower's chilled shellfish — the neutral profile carries the shellfish without weight, and the herbs play the buttery edge. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
