  "HDW 100 Vodka|Shrimp Cocktail": "HDW 100 with shrimp cocktail — 100-proof craft against cold shrimp. Excellent; HDW 100's herbal lift elevates the classic cold app at higher-proof register.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|Swordfish": "HDW 100 Vodka's char-herbal neutrality reads alongside the swordfish's meaty flesh — the neutral profile frames the fish cleanly, and the herbs play the buttery edge. Strong; the pairing reads cleanly.",
  "HDW 100 Vodka|The Tomahawk": "HDW 100 Vodka's crystalline neutrality underclubs the Tomahawk's theatrical bone-in marbling and smoky char -- vodka is neutral by design — the marbled char deserves a pour with character. The plate deserves Corazon Stagg, Opus One, or George T. Stagg, not a vodka. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Reserve the HDW 100 Vodka for another course.",
