  "Hakushu 12 Year|Gumbo": "Hakushu 12 Year's lightly-peated Hakushu character sits alongside the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the restrained whisky body threads the gumbo, and the umami-tinged finish frames the bowl. Works; EC 18 is over-specified for an app; save for the main.",
