  "Hakushu 12 Year|Loaded Potato": "Hakushu 12 Year's lightly-peated Hakushu character leans against the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the precise Japanese craft body wraps the loaded potato soup, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; save the collector bottle for the protein course.",
