  "Hakushu 12 Year|Market Fish": "Hakushu 12 Year's lightly-peated Hakushu character reads alongside the market fish's clean white-fish flesh: the lightly-peated Hakushu meets the market fish, and the forest-floor frames the plate. Works; JW Blue is over-specified for a side — save the bottle for the main course.",
