  "Hakushu 12 Year|Mushrooms": "Hakushu 12 with mushrooms — \"Forest Distillery\" Japanese single malt against earthy umami. Excellent; Hakushu's pine-forest notes marry mushroom earthiness with thematic forest-gin-meets-forest-fungi resonance — the featured Japanese-whisky-mushroom pairing at premium register.",
  "Hakushu 12 Year|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Hakushu 12 Year's lightly-peated Hakushu character sits alongside the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the PB brownie, and the umami-tinged finish frames the dessert. Works; the pour's complexity is underused by the salad.",
