  "Hakushu 12 Year|Swordfish": "Hakushu 12 Year's lightly-peated Hakushu character sits alongside the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the swordfish, and the sandalwood-and-honey register softens the plate. Works; OGD 16 frames the two-cut plate at distinctive register.",
