  "Hakushu 12 Year|Truffle Fries": "Hakushu 12 with truffle fries — \"Forest Distillery\" single malt against truffle-parmesan. Strong; Hakushu's pine-forest + subtle peat meets the earthy-rich with Forest-Distillery distinction.",
