  "Head Fake|Market Fish": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build sits with the fish's clean flesh — the sweet character meets the fish at digestif register, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Head Fake|Mocha Creme": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build plays cleanly against the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate dessert — the sweet character mirrors the dessert sugar, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Head Fake|Mushroom Bisque": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build plays cleanly against the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the sweet character sits at digestif register, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Head Fake|Mushrooms": "Wheatley vodka, limoncello, triple sec, lemon, simple syrup, sugar rim. Sweet lemon-drop clashes on every axis with mushroom umami; the cocktail's profile fights the side. Route to dessert or lighter courses. Avoid; the call reads off-register; recommend an alternative.",
  "Head Fake|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build leans against the PB brownie's peanut-cocoa stack — the sweet character mirrors the dessert sugar, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Head Fake|Porterhouse": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build plays cleanly against the porterhouse's two-cut character — the sweet character meets the cap-fat at digestif register, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Head Fake|Prime Tartare": "Prime Tartare: this rich, umami-forward starter's bold fat and concentrated savory depth meets this vodka cocktail's clean citrus lift and approachable sweetness. Light cocktail's citrus lift mirrors a delicate starter's brightness. Works cleanly.",
  "Head Fake|Rainbow Trout": "Head Fake's sweet citrus-lemon build sits with the trout's delicate flesh — the sweet character meets the fish at digestif register, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
