  "Hendricks Flora Adora|Truffle Fries": "Hendricks Flora Adora's crisp char-elderflower botanicals stays alongside the truffle fries' Parmesan-and-truffle salt — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the botanicals frame the umami depth. Works; reliable companion, low risk. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Hendricks Flora Adora|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Hendricks Flora Adora's gin lift with floral-and-pepper meets at register with the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust: the botanical-citrus register matches the tuna, and the coriander-and-cardamom edge frames the plate. Strong; reliable gin for the tuna.",
  "Hendricks Flora Adora|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Hendricks Flora Adora's crisp char-elderflower botanicals stays alongside the curry's spiced chickpea warmth — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the honey balances the spice. Works; composed but not a standout.",
