  "Hendricks Gin|Porterhouse": "Hendricks Gin's botanical-driven lift underclubs the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character -- gin's light register can't carry the marbled char — the cut deserves a bigger pour. The plate deserves Odette Cabernet Sauvignon, Weller 12 Year, or Domaine du Grand Tinel, not a gin. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Hold the Hendricks Gin for another course.",
