  "Hendricks Neptunia|Beignets": "Neptunia with beignets — Scottish-coast Hendrick's against fried dough. Strong; Neptunia's coastal profile is interesting with sugar but over-specified for casual dessert; Grand Cabaret's black-currant is better.",
  "Hendricks Neptunia|Bone Marrow": "Neptunia with bone marrow — coastal-release Hendrick's against umami fat. Avoid; gin can't cut marrow. Reach for Fernet Branca.",
  "Hendricks Neptunia|Bone-In Filet": "Hendricks Neptunia's botanical-driven lift mis-pairs with the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness -- gin's clean lift reads thin against the cut's weight. The plate deserves Opus One, Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, or Knob Creek 15 Year, not a gin. Avoid; the better calls are above. Hendricks Neptunia lands on another course — not here.",
  "Hendricks Neptunia|Broccoli Cheddar": "Hendricks Neptunia's crisp anise-brine botanicals plays cleanly against the broccoli cheddar's cream — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the herbs cut the cream. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
