  "Hendricks Neptunia|Porterhouse": "Hendricks Neptunia's botanical-driven lift underclubs the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character -- gin reads light against the prime cut's weight — needs a red or whiskey. The plate deserves Odette Cabernet Sauvignon, Weller 12 Year, or Domaine du Grand Tinel, not a gin. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Save the Hendricks Neptunia for another course.",
