  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Clam Chowder": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony finds neutral with the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the precise Japanese craft body wraps the chowder, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Cowboy Ribeye": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony leans against the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness: the restrained whisky body threads the cap-fat ribeye, and the precision rounds the cut. Works; Vermont-brand at matched register.",
