  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Creme Brulee": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony finds neutral with the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the brulee, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; master-blender doesn't drive.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Escargot": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's Japanese-blend-honey character holds steady against the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the bourbon depth cuts the umami fat, and the rounded sweetness meets the herb butter. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Faroe Island Salmon": "Hibiki Harmony with the salmon — refined premium Suntory blend against oily salmon. Excellent; Hibiki's elegant-delicate character frames fish at premium Japanese register — Japanese whisky's category advantage with the refinement to elevate.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Filet Mignon": "Filet Mignon: tenderloin meets premium Suntory blend, 5+ cask types, refined-elegant iconic Japanese-blend premium. Hibiki's refined-elegant character frames tenderloin with premium Japanese-blend gravitas — where Toki is crowd-pleasing entry, Hibiki is refined-premium, and the harmony of 5+ cask types is the featured Japanese-blend-filet match. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
