  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Loaded Potato": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony leans against the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the loaded potato soup, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; boutique character gives the dessert a craft frame.",
