  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Mushroom Bisque": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the blended-whisky harmony frames the mushroom bisque, and the oak frames the umami. Works; Caribbean Cask rides the cream at distinctive register.",
