  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Porterhouse": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's Japanese-blend-honey character sits with the porterhouse's two-cut character — the bourbon depth grips the marbled cut, and the honey rounds the grilled char. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Prime Tartare": "Hibiki Harmony with the tartare — refined premium Suntory blend against raw beef. Excellent; Hibiki's elegant harmony of 5+ cask types is the featured Japanese-whisky-tartare pairing — the refinement lifts tartare's minerality at premium register.",
  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Rainbow Trout": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony finds neutral with the trout's delicate flesh: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the trout, and the precision rounds the plate. Works; Remus 15 is over-specified for an app; save for the main.",
