  "Hibiki Japanese Harmony|Salt-Cured Halibut": "Hibiki Japanese Harmony's blended Japanese harmony reads alongside the halibut's salt-cured flesh: the blended-whisky harmony frames the halibut, and the silky body rounds the plate. Works; boutique-release covers both cuts without standing out.",
