  "Honey Roasted Carrots|Sauternes Glass": "Sauternes Glass' dessert-wine sweetness clashes with the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness -- sweet wine on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, not a dessert wine. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Sauternes Glass belongs on the steak course.",
