  "Inverroche Gin|Escargot": "Inverroche with escargot — fynbos-floral gin against garlic-butter snails. Strong; Inverroche's Cape botanicals meet butter with distinctive floral character; Mahón's Mediterranean juniper cuts it harder.",
  "Inverroche Gin|Faroe Island Salmon": "Inverroche with the salmon — Western Cape fynbos gin against oily salmon. Excellent; Inverroche's floral-herbal profile is the featured Botanical-Forward Craft Gin-salmon pairing — the Cape-fynbos lift frames the fish with terroir specificity.",
