  "Inverroche Gin|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Inverroche Gin's crisp earth-floral botanicals leans against the carrots' honeyed sweetness — the botanical edge sits with the light side, and the herbs echo the green plate. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Inverroche Gin|House Wedge": "Inverroche with the House Wedge — South African fynbos gin against iceberg and bleu. Strong; Inverroche's Cape-floral meets the bleu with terroir-specific character.",
