  "Inverroche Gin|Market Fish": "Inverroche Gin's juniper-and-citrus lift sits alongside the market fish's clean white-fish flesh: the floral edge frames the market fish, and the juniper threads the plate. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Inverroche Gin|Mocha Creme": "Inverroche Gin's botanical-driven lift fights the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- juniper and cocoa refuse each other — botanical bitterness reads metallic against chocolate. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not a gin. Avoid; one of those is the move. Inverroche Gin lands on the steak course — not here.",
