  "Inverroche Gin|Seafood Tower": "Inverroche with the seafood tower — South African fynbos gin against the raw bar. Excellent; Inverroche's Cape-floral character gives the tower a distinctive terroir-story pairing — the fynbos bloom-profile lifts the raw bar with elegance.",
