  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Prime Tartare": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks's agave-juniper character holds steady against the tartare's raw beef and brine — the aged-oak depth meets the rich starter. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Rainbow Trout": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks' oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the trout's delicate flesh -- bourbon depth belongs with red meat, not a flaky main. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bourbon. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Reserve the Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks for the steak course.",
  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Roast Half Chicken": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks' oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth finds neutral with the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast: the caramel-spice register matches the roast chicken, and the oak frames the plate. Works; bonded weight a touch ambitious for the dessert.",
  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks' oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth reads alongside the chickpea soup's roasted-pepper chickpea warmth: the oak depth lays under the chickpea soup, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the bowl. Works; EHT Full Proof handles the richness at historic Kentucky register.",
  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Salt-Cured Halibut": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks' oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth flattens the halibut's salt-cured flesh -- oak-and-vanilla density rolls over the gentle flesh without lifting it. The plate deserves Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Far Niente Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks|Sauteed Garlic Spinach": "Ironfish Bourbon in Mezcal Casks' oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth sits alongside the garlic spinach's garlic-buttered greens: the caramel-spice register matches the garlic spinach, and the oak frames the side. Works; curated doesn't drive.",
