  "Isaac Bowman Port Finish|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Isaac Bowman Port Finish's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth swallows the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not a bourbon. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Pour the Isaac Bowman Port Finish on the steak course instead.",
  "Isaac Bowman Port Finish|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Isaac Bowman Port Finish's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth finds neutral with the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the caramel-spice register matches the curry, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the bowl. Works; IW Harper 15 frames the two-cut plate at aged-KY-heritage register.",
  "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards|Asparagus": "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards's cherry-coffee tannin reads alongside the asparagus's green-vegetal edge — the medium-body red frames the green plate, and the cassis underlines the green edge. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
