  "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards|Escargot": "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards' silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift sits alongside the escargot's garlic-herb-butter savory weight: the Pinot body brightens the buttered escargot, and the cherry-and-earth note frames the starter. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards|Faroe Island Salmon": "Anderson Valley Pinot — concentrated, dark cherry, blackberry, mocha, refined tannin. The concentrated structure plays against salmon's oil-rich flesh; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Peak Anderson Valley Pinot for salmon — cool-climate depth across seasonal preparations. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards|Filet Mignon": "Anderson Valley Pinot — concentrated-cool-climate style, dark cherry, blackberry, mocha, firm-but-refined tannin, long finish. The refined structure meets butter-tender filet's lean sweetness and the mocha plays against escargot-butter. Peak Anderson Valley Pinot for filet — concentrated Mendocino red on the delicate cut. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
