  "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards|Tomato Basil": "J Davies Ferrington Vineyards's cherry-coffee tannin reads alongside the tomato basil's bright acid — the medium-body red meets the light soup, and the cassis frames the herb butter. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
