  "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7|Filet Mignon": "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7 with the filet — iconic Tennessee whiskey against tenderloin. Excellent; Old No. 7's Lincoln County Process + charcoal-mellowing frames tenderloin with crowd-pleasing Tennessee character — the democratic Tennessee-filet pairing.",
