  "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7|Loaded Potato": "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth leans against the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the brown-spirit warmth threads the loaded potato soup, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; distinctive character is worth mentioning tableside, even if the pairing isn't marquee.",
