  "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Jack Daniel's Old No. 7's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth finds neutral with the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the bourbon body sits with the curry, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the bowl. Works; light body doesn't overshoot.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Asparagus": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone finds neutral with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the bourbon backbone carries the asparagus, and the oak-and-spice register settles the side. Works; the distinctive character is underused by the salad's simplicity.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Au Gratin Potatoes": "JD Sinatra Select with the au gratin — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against cheese-and-cream potatoes. Works; Sinatra Select handles the richness at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Beignets": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the brown-spirit warmth threads the beignets, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Bone Marrow": "JD Sinatra Select with bone marrow — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against umami fat. Excellent; Sinatra Select's richer oak engages marrow at Sinatra-tribute register — tied with JD 12 Year as the featured JD-marrow match.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Bone-In Filet": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's bold char-malt character matches the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the bourbon weight grips the lean cut, and the smoke meets the char. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Broccoli Cheddar": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's rounded-oak bourbon character finds neutral with the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the caramel-spice register matches the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Broccolini": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight reads alongside the broccolini's tender green stalks: the bourbon depth settles into the broccolini, and the vanilla softens the side. Works; extended maturation gives the dessert home-state aged character.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Brussels and Belly": "JD Sinatra Select with Brussels + Belly — Sinatra Barrels Tennessee against maple-glazed pork belly. Strong; Sinatra Select's richer oak meets the glaze at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Burrata": "JD Sinatra Select with burrata — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against fresh dairy. Avoid; Tennessee weight wrong for burrata.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Butternut Squash": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth finds neutral with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the bourbon depth settles into the squash bisque, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; the 10-year's restraint lets the soup lead.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Carrot Cake": "JD Sinatra Select with carrot cake — Sinatra Barrels Tennessee against cream cheese and cinnamon. Strong; Sinatra Select's grooved-barrel character threads the cake at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Cheesecake": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's soft-oak bourbon body sits alongside the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the brown-spirit warmth threads the cheesecake, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; Discovery complexity wasted on salad simplicity.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Chilean Seabass": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- bourbon depth belongs with red meat, not a flaky main. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Chocolate Brownie": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's rounded-oak bourbon character reads alongside the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight: the bourbon depth settles into the brownie, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Chocolate Cake": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth sits alongside the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the oak depth lays under the chocolate cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Clam Chowder": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight reads alongside the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the bourbon weight handles the chowder, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; boutique-craft doesn't drive.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Cowboy Ribeye": "JD Sinatra Select with the cowboy ribeye — Sinatra Barrels Tennessee against 26oz bone-in cap-fat. Excellent; Sinatra Select's extra-oak grooved-barrel character is the featured JD-ribeye pairing — the unique barrel treatment gives it backbone for cap-fat the entry JDs can't match.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Crab Cake": "JD Sinatra Select with crab cake — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against delicate lump crab. Avoid; Tennessee wrong for seafood. Reach for a vodka or gin.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Creamed Spinach": "JD Sinatra Select with creamed spinach — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against dairy-rich side. Strong; Sinatra Select's extra oak rides the cream at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Creamy Potato": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's rounded-oak bourbon character sits alongside the potato soup's silky-bodied cream: the oak depth lays under the potato soup, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Creme Brulee": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone reads alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the bourbon weight handles the brulee, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; HH 20 frames the two-cut plate at collector register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Escargot": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's bold char-malt character matches the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the caramel-oak depth threads the savory plate, and the oak frames the umami. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Faroe Island Salmon": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth smothers the salmon's rich oily flesh -- sweet-spirit register doubles the natural fish-richness — no contrast. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a bourbon. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Filet Mignon": "JD Sinatra Select with the filet — Frank Sinatra tribute Tennessee, \"Sinatra Barrels\" with special grooves that expose whiskey to extra oak surface, richer-oakier unique expression. Excellent; Sinatra Select's grooved-barrel character frames tenderloin with Sinatra-tribute gravitas — a premium JD that tells a story at the table.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|French Onion": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's grain-and-oak bourbon register leans against the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the bourbon weight handles the French onion, and the oak-and-spice register settles the bowl. Works; cleaner than wheated versions but not exceptional.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Grilled Caesar": "JD Sinatra Select with the grilled Caesar — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against charred romaine and anchovy. Strong; Sinatra Select's extra oak meets the char at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Gumbo": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth leans against the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the bourbon depth settles into the gumbo, and the vanilla softens the bowl. Works; annual-release wasted on salad.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's grain-and-oak bourbon register finds neutral with the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the bourbon depth settles into the honey carrots, and the oak frames the caramelized sugar. Works; Voyage 23 frames the cut at ocean-finish register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|House Wedge": "JD Sinatra Select with the House Wedge — Sinatra Barrels Tennessee against iceberg and bleu. Strong; Sinatra Select's grooved-barrel character engages the bleu at Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Kansas City": "JD Sinatra Select with the KC — Sinatra-tribute Tennessee against an 18oz strip. Excellent; Sinatra Select's grooved-barrel oak depth handles strip marbling at premium Sinatra-tribute register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Loaded Potato": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's grain-and-oak bourbon register leans against the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the caramel-spice register matches the loaded potato soup, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; Gran Cru's brioche meets the glaze at refined register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Lobster Mac": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the oak depth lays under the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Market Fish": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth smothers the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- the brown-spirit weight pulls focus off the delicate fish protein. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a bourbon. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Pour the Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select on the steak course instead.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Mocha Creme": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness: the bourbon body sits with the mocha creme, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; JD 12 handles the richness at premium register.",
