  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Seasonal Vegetables": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's grain-and-oak bourbon register sits alongside the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the bourbon body sits with the seasonal vegetables, and the vanilla softens the side. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Shrimp Bisque": "JD Sinatra Select with shrimp bisque — Sinatra Barrels Tennessee against cream-shrimp soup. Works; Sinatra Select's extra oak rides the bisque at Sinatra-tribute register.",
