  "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight sits alongside the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the bourbon depth settles into the curry, and the vanilla softens the bowl. Works; Remus 15 handles dessert density at Gatsby-tribute register.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Asparagus": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness sits alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the malt-grain blend handles the asparagus, and the grain register softens the side. Works; the 80-proof softness doesn't overshoot the salad the way heavier bourbons do.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness reads alongside the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the soft malt-and-grain weight wraps the au gratin, and the oak softens the cream. Works; annual-release complexity over-specified.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Beignets": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the approachable Irish character carries the beignets, and the triple-distilled smoothness brightens the dessert. Works; annual-release story wasted on salad.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Bone Marrow": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's crisp triple-distilled-smooth character matches the marrow's umami-fat depth — the bourbon weight grips the savory plate. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Bone-In Filet": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the gentle Irish body threads the bone-enhanced filet, and the soft malt rounds the cut. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
