  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Broccolini": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness reads alongside the broccolini's tender green stalks: the Irish whiskey body sits with the broccolini, and the soft malt rounds the side. Works; boutique over-specified.",
