  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Burrata": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness crowds out the burrata's fresh basil-tomato-cream delicacy -- bourbon depth is wrong for the table's opening course. The plate deserves Il Colle Prosecco Superiore, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, not an Irish whiskey. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Reserve the Jameson Irish Whiskey for the steak course.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Butternut Squash": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the gentle Irish body threads the squash bisque, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; BH Red Wine Cask meets the char at distinctive register.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Carrot Cake": "Jameson with carrot cake — smooth triple-distilled Irish against cream cheese and cinnamon. Works; Jameson's sherry-cask character threads the cake at entry register.",
