  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Chilean Seabass": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness clashes with the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- the oily flesh and the brown-spirit oak refuse to meet cleanly. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not an Irish whiskey. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Hold the Jameson Irish Whiskey for the steak course.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Chocolate Brownie": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness sits alongside the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight: the gentle Irish body threads the brownie, and the gentle barley note frames the dessert. Works; boutique character gives the dessert a craft frame.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Chocolate Cake": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the soft malt-and-grain weight wraps the chocolate cake, and the soft malt rounds the dessert. Works; private-selection wasted on the salad.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Clam Chowder": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the approachable Irish character carries the chowder, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; gentle match.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Cowboy Ribeye": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness sits alongside the cowboy ribeye's marbled char-and-fat richness: the approachable Irish character carries the cap-fat ribeye, and the gentle barley note frames the cut. Works; the light body doesn't overshoot the salad.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Crab Cake": "Jameson with crab cake — smooth triple-distilled Irish against delicate lump crab. Works; Jameson is one of the few whiskies light enough to sit alongside crab without overwhelming — Irish whiskey's triple-distilled softness is the category advantage. Not featured (vodka or gin still lead), but Jameson is the whisky-curious pairing.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Creamed Spinach": "Jameson with creamed spinach — iconic Irish against dairy-rich side. Works; Jameson's smoothness rides the cream at entry Irish register.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Creamy Potato": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness sits alongside the potato soup's silky-bodied cream: the triple-distilled softness sits with the potato soup, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Creme Brulee": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness finds neutral with the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the smooth triple-distilled register matches the brulee, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; pour is a touch over-specified for the dessert.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Escargot": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's crisp triple-distilled-smooth character frames the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the aged-oak depth meets the rich starter. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Faroe Island Salmon": "Faroe Island Salmon: oily salmon meets iconic smooth Irish. Jameson's sherry+bourbon-cask triple-distilled character frames fish at crowd-pleasing register — Irish whiskey is one of the few whisky categories that actually handles salmon, and Jameson leads this lane. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Filet Mignon": "Jameson with the filet — iconic smooth Irish against tenderloin. Excellent; Jameson's crowd-pleasing character frames tenderloin at entry Irish register — the democratic Irish-filet pairing.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|French Onion": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the malt-grain blend handles the French onion, and the gentle barley note frames the bowl. Works; the 10-year holds without lifting.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Grilled Caesar": "Jameson with the grilled Caesar — iconic smooth Irish against charred romaine and anchovy. Strong; Jameson's softness meets the char at entry register; Tullamore D.E.W.'s drier heritage is the featured entry-Irish-Caesar pairing.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Gumbo": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the Irish whiskey body sits with the gumbo, and the gentle barley note frames the bowl. Works; polished aged character doesn't drive.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness reads alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the approachable Irish character carries the honey carrots, and the oak softens the caramelized sugar. Works; OGD 16 is over-specified for an app; save for the main.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|House Wedge": "Jameson with the House Wedge — entry Irish against iceberg and bleu. Excellent; Jameson's smooth character threads the wedge with crowd-pleasing Irish distinction.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Kansas City": "Jameson with the KC — triple-distilled iconic Irish against an 18oz strip. Excellent; Jameson handles the strip at crowd-pleasing register — lighter than Scotch but with enough sherry+bourbon-cask depth for marbling.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Loaded Potato": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness sits alongside the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the gentle Irish body threads the loaded potato soup, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; the pour's assertiveness is a bit much for the soup but doesn't clash.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Lobster Mac": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the triple-distilled softness sits with the lobster mac, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
