  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Mushroom Bisque": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the smooth triple-distilled register matches the mushroom bisque, and the oak underlines the umami weight. Works; Fortuna's NZ terroir meets the glaze at distinctive register.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Mushrooms": "Jameson with mushrooms — smooth triple-distilled Irish against earthy umami. Strong; Jameson's sherry+bourbon-cask character threads mushrooms at entry register; Redbreast 12's pot still depth is the featured Irish-mushroom match.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the smooth triple-distilled register matches the PB brownie, and the grain register softens the dessert. Works; Remus 15 handles dessert density at Gatsby-tribute register.",
  "Jameson Irish Whiskey|Porterhouse": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character: the triple-distilled softness sits with the dual-cut steak, and the malt rounds the cut. Works; curated single-barrel slightly over-specified.",
