  "Jefferson's Reserve|Swordfish": "Jefferson's Reserve's blended honey and vanilla swallows the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Pour the Jefferson's Reserve on the steak course instead.",
