  "Jim Beam Black Label|Broccoli Cheddar": "Jim Beam Black Label's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth reads alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon body sits with the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; own-plus-sourced covers both cuts without standing out.",
