  "Jim Beam Black Label|Brussels and Belly": "Jim Beam Black Label with Brussels + Belly — 86-proof aged Beam meets maple-glazed pork belly. The oak cuts the glaze's sweetness more cleanly than White Label manages; a solid small-plate pairing. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
