  "Jim Beam Black Label|Clam Chowder": "Jim Beam Black Label's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight reads alongside the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the chowder, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; X Commandments story wasted on salad.",
  "Jim Beam Black Label|Cowboy Ribeye": "Jim Beam Black Label with the Cowboy Ribeye — 86-proof aged Beam against cap fat and char. Strong; the aging helps vs. White Label, but Knob Creek or Weller 12 are the better ribeye calls.",
