  "Johnnie Walker Black|Loaded Potato": "Johnnie Walker Black's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the scotch depth settles into the loaded potato soup, and the oak softens the cream. Works; Remus 15 is over-specified for an app; save for the main.",
