  "Johnnie Walker Blue|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Johnnie Walker Blue's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the scotch depth settles into the PB brownie, and the malt edge frames the dessert. Works; the 100-proof is a touch over-specified for the dessert's register.",
