  "Johnnie Walker Red|Beignets": "Johnnie Walker Red's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry: the malt-driven body wraps the beignets, and the honey rounds the dessert. Works; the extra proof overpowers this dish.",
