  "Johnnie Walker Red|Bone-In Filet": "Johnnie Walker Red's Highland-scotch character sits alongside the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the malt-and-oak threads the bone-enhanced filet, and the malt edge frames the cut. Works; the premium pour is wasted on the salad's simplicity.",
