  "Johnnie Walker Red|Cowboy Ribeye": "JW Red with the cowboy ribeye — peat-influenced entry JW against 26oz bone-in cap-fat. Excellent; JW Red's bold-smoke is the featured blended-Scotch-ribeye pairing at entry register — the Islay-malt punch handles cap-fat intensity.",
