  "Jubilation by Colgin|Gumbo": "Jubilation by Colgin's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth overwhelms the gumbo's spiced creole stew -- the red is built for protein weight, not a light soup or salad base. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Fattoria Le Pupille Saffredi, or Muga Reserva, not an elegant red. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Jubilation by Colgin for the steak course.",
