  "Jubilation by Colgin|House Wedge": "Jubilation — Colgin cult Napa, blackcurrant, dark chocolate, violets, espresso, firm tannin. The firm tannin cuts iceberg-and-bacon and the dark chocolate plays against blue cheese dressing. Works as cult Napa for the wedge — Pritchard Hill structure on the salad; whites peak higher.",
  "Jubilation by Colgin|Kansas City": "Jubilation — Colgin cult Napa, blackcurrant, dark chocolate, violets, espresso, firm tannin. The firm tannin handles Kansas City's lean-bold marbled strip and the espresso plays against the beefy char. Strong cult Napa for the strip — Pritchard Hill on the American steakhouse cut.",
