  "Kahlua|Asparagus": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge -- a sweet liqueur on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, Joseph Mellot Sancerre, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a digestif. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Kahlua belongs on the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust -- a sweet liqueur on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, not a digestif. Avoid; the better calls are above. Save the Kahlua for the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Beignets": "★ Kahlua's sweet coffee-rum-base depth meets head-on the beignet's warm sugar-dusted pastry — the sweet character mirrors the dessert sugar. Gold standard; the unskippable match for this combo.",
  "Kahlua|Bone Marrow": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the bone marrow's unctuous rendered-marrow richness -- sweet liqueur is dessert energy — wrong place for the table's first course. The plate deserves Fernet Branca, Lagavulin 8, or George T. Stagg, not a digestif. Avoid; one of those is the move. Kahlua lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Kahlua|Bone-In Filet": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness -- sweet liqueur is post-meal territory — wrong register for any steak course. The plate deserves Opus One, Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, or Knob Creek 15 Year, not a digestif. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Kahlua belongs on another course.",
  "Kahlua|Broccoli Cheddar": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character overwhelms the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream -- the liqueur's sweetness buries the soup's creamy base instead of supporting it. The plate deserves Keenan Chardonnay, Far Niente Chardonnay, or Alexander Valley Chardonnay, not a digestif. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Kahlua lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Kahlua|Broccolini": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- sugar on a clean vegetable side is wrong direction — needs herb-acid lift, not sweetness. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a digestif. Avoid; the better calls are above. Kahlua belongs on the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Brussels and Belly": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character doubles down on Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts -- sweet liqueur and a sweet glaze double the sugar register — no contrast left. The plate deserves Corazon Weller, Angel's Envy, or Maker's Mark, not a digestif. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Kahlua belongs on the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Burrata": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the burrata's fresh basil-tomato-cream delicacy -- sweet liqueur is dessert energy — wrong place for the table's first course. The plate deserves Il Colle Prosecco Superiore, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, not a digestif. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Pour the Kahlua on the steak course instead.",
  "Kahlua|Butternut Squash": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream -- sugar piled onto cream is dessert-course energy on a savory plate — no contrast. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a digestif. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Kahlua for the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Carrot Cake": "Carrot Cake: cream cheese and cinnamon meet Kahlua. Works; the coffee-rum-sugar profile amplifies cake spice at coffee-liqueur register.",
  "Kahlua|Cheesecake": "Kahlua's sweet coffee-rum-base depth sits with the cheesecake's custard cream — the sweet character mirrors the dessert sugar, and the coffee threads the cream. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Kahlua|Chilean Seabass": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- the liqueur's sugar piles onto the fish's natural oils with no lift. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a digestif. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Hold the Kahlua for the steak course.",
  "Kahlua|Chocolate Brownie": "Chocolate Brownie: warm dark chocolate meets Kahlua. Excellent; one of the strong calls on the list.",
  "Kahlua|Chocolate Cake": "Chocolate Cake: layered chocolate dessert meets Kahlua. Excellent; the Arabica-rum-base profile threads chocolate layers at 20% register — Kahlua is the quintessential chocolate-dessert liqueur.",
  "Kahlua|Clam Chowder": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base -- sugar piled onto cream is dessert-course energy on a savory plate — no contrast. The plate deserves Keenan Chardonnay, Far Niente Chardonnay, or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a digestif. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Kahlua lands on the steak course — not here.",
