  "Kahlua|Faroe Island Salmon": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the salmon's rich oily flesh -- a sweet liqueur is dessert-course energy — wrong register for any main protein. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a digestif. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Save the Kahlua for the steak course.",
