  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Broccoli Cheddar": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the rye spice cuts the broccoli cheddar, and the oak threads the cream. Works; a gentle, everyday match.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Broccolini": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the broccolini's tender green stalks: the rye spice cuts the broccolini, and the rye edge frames the side. Works; the 80-proof softness doesn't overshoot the salad the way heavier bourbons do.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Brussels and Belly": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye with Brussels + Belly — allocated KO meets maple-glazed pork belly. The premium KY rye character cuts the glaze with KO distinctiveness. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
