  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Butternut Squash": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the dry rye body wraps the squash bisque, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Carrot Cake": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the high-rye spice register matches the carrot cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; save the bottle for the protein course — a soup is wrong for a $200 pour.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Cheesecake": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character leans against the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the rye-pepper edge sharpens the cheesecake, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; novelty maturation at matched register.",
