  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the rye-and-oak weight handles the honey carrots, and the oak softens the caramelized sugar. Works; annual-release complexity over-specified.",
