  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Loaded Potato": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character finds neutral with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the rye spice cuts the loaded potato soup, and the oak softens the cream. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Lobster Mac": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the rye backbone drives the lobster mac, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Market Fish": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character smothers the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- the brown-spirit weight pulls focus off the delicate fish protein. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a rye whiskey. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Hold the Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye for the steak course.",
