  "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye|Seafood Tower": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character smothers the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- bourbon warmth has no foil against cold, clean shellfish. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a rye whiskey. Avoid; one of those is the move. Hold the Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye for the steak course.",
