  "Knickerbocker Gin|Swordfish": "Knickerbocker Gin's bold citrus-juniper botanicals plays cleanly against the swordfish's meaty flesh — the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
