  "Knob Creek 12 Year|Truffle Fries": "Knob Creek 12 Year with truffle fries — aged 12-year Beam against truffle-parmesan. The aging brings more oak-driven grip to the side than standard Knob Creek delivers. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Knob Creek 12 Year|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Knob Creek 12 Year's aged 12 years at 100 proof flattens the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- oak-and-vanilla density rolls over the seared crust without lifting it. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not a bourbon. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Knob Creek 12 Year belongs on the steak course.",
