  "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye|Bone Marrow": "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye with bone marrow — blended bourbon-and-rye against umami fat. The layered complexity threads through marrow's mineral finish with more vocabulary than straight bourbon brings. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
