  "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye|Broccoli Cheddar": "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye's rye-spice character leans against the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the rye backbone drives the broccoli cheddar, and the oak softens the cream. Works; the single-barrel depth is over-specified for this dish.",
