  "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye|Brussels and Belly": "Knob Creek Bourbon/Rye with Brussels + Belly — bourbon-and-rye blend meets maple-glazed pork belly. The rye portion cuts the glaze's sweetness while the bourbon portion meets the pork fat; a layered small-plate pairing. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
