  "Komos Anejo Reserva|Filet Mignon": "Filet Mignon: tender lean cut meets Komos Anejo Reserva. Excellent; the French-oak + wine-cask finishes bring distinctive complexity to filet at luxury-reserve register — Komos is the craftsman-curated alternative to Clase Azul.",
