  "Komos Anejo Reserva|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Komos Anejo Reserva's rested-agave body sits alongside the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the honey carrots, and the soft-spice note softens the side. Works; the pairing is less about match and more about experience.",
  "Komos Anejo Reserva|House Wedge": "Komos Anejo Reserva's aged-agave character finds neutral with the wedge's iceberg-and-bleu cool crunch: the aged-agave weight wraps the wedge, and the caramel-agave register brightens the bowl. Works; extended-aged complexity handles richness at Los-Altos register.",
  "Komos Anejo Reserva|Kansas City": "Komos Anejo Reserva: ultra-premium Los Altos tequila, 12-14 months in French oak + Hungarian + ex-Moscow wine barrels — wine-cask-finish distinctive among luxury añejos. Excellent on KC strip; the wine-cask-finished character frames the lean cut at ceremonial-luxury register — save the bottle for the guest who wants the wine-cask-distinctive añejo expression.",
