  "Komos Crystallino Anejo|Brussels and Belly": "Brussels and Belly: maple-glazed meets Komos Crystallino. Excellent; the crystallino-filtered-anejo character plays the maple glaze at trendy register — unexpected pairing through filtered-depth.",
