  "Lail Vineyards Daniel Cuvée|Butternut Squash": "Lail Vineyards Daniel Cuvée's bold floral-oak cassis plays cleanly against the squash soup's silky sweet — the opulent body overshoots the light soup, and the oak frames the caramelized sugar. Works; the pairing reads neutral at the table. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
