  "Lail Vineyards Daniel Cuvée|Truffle Fries": "Lail flagship multi-appellation Napa Cab — dark fruit, cassis, graphite, dried violet, firm tannin. The firm tannin cuts truffle-fry potato fat and the graphite plays against the truffle-oil umami. Peak historically-significant Napa Cab for truffle fries — Lail family structure on the umami hit. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
