  "Lalo Silver|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Lalo Silver's green-agave-and-cane lift finds neutral with the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the unaged body brightens the au gratin, and the unaged-cane note plays against the side. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
  "Lalo Silver|Beignets": "Lalo Silver's unaged blanco-tequila lift with agave-citrus snap falls short of the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- light spirit reads thin against dessert sweetness. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not a light spirit. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Pour the Lalo Silver on the steak course instead.",
