  "Licor 43|French Onion": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth -- the soup-salad course needs lift or acid — sweet liqueur brings neither. The plate deserves Daniel Chotard Sancerre Rouge, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, not a digestif. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Licor 43 belongs on the steak course.",
  "Licor 43|Grilled Caesar": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the Caesar's charred-romaine and anchovy edge -- the soup-salad course needs lift or acid — sweet liqueur brings neither. The plate deserves Green Chartreuse, Tanqueray Gin, or Scavino Barolo, not a digestif. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Pour the Licor 43 on the steak course instead.",
