  "Licor 43|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness -- sweet liqueur and a sweet glaze double the sugar register — no contrast left. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, not a digestif. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Hold the Licor 43 for the steak course.",
