  "Licor 43|Kansas City": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the KC's lean-bold strip with savory grain -- a sweet liqueur belongs after the meal, not during the steak course. The plate deserves Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, Pio Cesare Barbaresco, or Pappy Van Winkle 13 Year Rye, not a digestif. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Save the Licor 43 for another course.",
  "Licor 43|Loaded Potato": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character doubles down on the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup -- sugar piled onto cream is dessert-course energy on a savory plate — no contrast. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a digestif. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Pour the Licor 43 on the steak course instead.",
  "Licor 43|Lobster Mac": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence -- a sweet liqueur on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, not a digestif. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Pour the Licor 43 on the steak course instead.",
