  "Loaded Potato|Louis XIII Cognac": "Louis XIII Cognac's luxury-icon cognac depth mis-pairs with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup -- an icon cognac on a soup-salad course is wrong moment — its register demands the close, not the open. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not an icon cognac. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Louis XIII Cognac lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Loaded Potato|Lucano Amaro": "Lucano Amaro's bitter-herb aperitivo edge clashes with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup -- amaro bitterness on dairy cream reads metallic — no bridge from herbal sharp to soft fat. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; one of those is the move. Lucano Amaro belongs on the steak course.",
