  "Loaded Potato|Truffle Fries": "The loaded potato and the truffle fries -- potato-on-potato, the meal goes redundant. Avoid; the table reads heavy without payoff. Suggest Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir for the loaded potato, or The Tomahawk, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Belvedere Vodka for the truffle fries.",
