  "Loaded Potato|Venge Scout's Honor": "Venge Scout's Honor's bold pepper-vanilla cassis plays cleanly against the loaded potato's richness — the concentrated body matches the heavy soup, and the caramel-spice settles the cream. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
