  "Lobster Mac|Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select": "Jack Daniel's Sinatra Select's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the oak depth lays under the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
  "Lobster Mac|Jameson Irish Whiskey": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the triple-distilled softness sits with the lobster mac, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
  "Lobster Mac|Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir": "Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin leans against the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the medium-body red sits with the rich side, and the cherry-fruit rounds the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Lobster Mac|Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis": "Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis: this crisp white's citrus-driven acidity and mineral edge meets this rich, creamy side's dairy-driven indulgence. Crisp white acidity cuts dairy richness — palate-cleansing counterpoint. Strong — the acid refreshes the fat.",
