  "Lobster Mac|Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak": "Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak's soft-oak bourbon body leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the bourbon weight handles the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; not revelatory but well-matched registers.",
  "Lobster Mac|Jim Beam Black Label": "Jim Beam Black Label's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone reads alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the caramel-spice register matches the lobster mac, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
