  "Lobster Mac|Laurent Perrier Brut Rosé": "Laurent Perrier Brut Rosé's crisp berry-cherry acidity reads alongside the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the mousse-and-acid sits with the plate, and the cherry-fruit rounds the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Lobster Mac|Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut": "Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut: this versatile sparkling's bright acidity, toasty lees character, and cleansing bubbles meets this rich, creamy side's dairy-driven indulgence. Acid and bubbles scrub the side's fat while brightness keeps the palate clear. A headliner match — context-driven peak. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
