  "Lobster Mac|Les Pallières Raciné": "Les Pallières Raciné's bold earth-mineral cassis finds neutral with the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the opulent body matches the indulgent side, and the mineral edge mirrors the briny meat. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Lobster Mac|Liberator Gin": "Liberator Gin's citrus-juniper botanicals sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the gin botanicals sit with the plate, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Lobster Mac|Licor 43": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence -- a sweet liqueur on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, not a digestif. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Pour the Licor 43 on the steak course instead.",
  "Lobster Mac|Limoncello": "Limoncello's sweet liqueur character overwhelms the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence -- the liqueur's sugar buries the side's cream instead of lifting it. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, not a digestif. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Pour the Limoncello on the steak course instead.",
  "Lobster Mac|Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir": "Willamette Pinot — dark cherry, forest floor, low tannin. The forest floor meets truffle earthiness directly; low tannin keeps the lobster's delicacy intact and doesn't bully the cream. Non-obvious red route for the mac on a mixed table. Strong; consistent recommendation across the table.",
  "Lobster Mac|Little Book": "Little Book's rounded-oak bourbon character sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the bourbon backbone carries the lobster mac, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; boutique character slightly over-specified.",
  "Lobster Mac|Loaded Potato": "The loaded potato alongside the lobster mac -- both cream-forward, the meal goes heavy on the table. Works; the table can build them in order or together.",
  "Lobster Mac|Loch Lomond 20 Year": "Loch Lomond 20 Year's Highland-scotch character leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the malt-and-oak threads the lobster mac, and the oak softens the cream. Works; milestone-release doesn't drive.",
