  "Lobster Mac|New Holland Beer Barrel Bourbon": "New Holland Beer Barrel Bourbon's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the bourbon depth settles into the lobster mac, and the caramel softens the cream. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
