  "Lobster Mac|Opus One": "Opus One — Oakville Bordeaux blend, dark fruit, mocha, cedar, dried violet, firm tannin. The firm tannin cuts lobster-mac's cream-cheese richness and the mocha plays against the dense pasta. Strong collector Napa blend for lobster mac — prestige wine on the indulgent side.",
