  "Lobster Mac|St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc": "St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc's citrus-lemon acidity plays cleanly against the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the crisp acidity sits with the plate, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
