  "Lobster Mac|Stagg Jr. Batch #15": "Stagg Jr. Batch #15's grain-and-oak bourbon register sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; HH 20's aged character meets the glaze at collector register.",
