  "Lobster Mac|Tenuta di Arceno Chianti Classico": "Tenuta di Arceno Chianti Classico's cherry-earth tannin reads alongside the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the medium-body red sits with the rich side, and the herbs play the buttery edge. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
  "Lobster Mac|The BG": "The BG's crisp citrus-earth build plays cleanly against the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the cocktail lift cleans the rich side, and the honey threads the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Lobster Mac|The Happy Wife": "The Happy Wife's crisp citrus-ginger build sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the cocktail lift cleans the rich side, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Lobster Mac|The Manhattan": "Maker's private barrel, Contratto vermouth, vanilla syrup, Angostura. The vanilla-bourbon depth meets the lobster mac's cream-and-shellfish richness; Contratto's herbal sweetness bridges the cheese cream. Peak cocktail for rich seafood-indulgent side when guest wants whiskey-forward option.",
  "Lobster Mac|The Prisoner Red Blend": "The Prisoner Red Blend's bold char cassis sits beside the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the concentrated body settles into the rich side. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Lobster Mac|The Tomahawk": "The Tomahawk alongside the lobster mac -- the Tomahawk's theatrical bone-in marbling and smoky char frames the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence. Excellent; one of the strong calls on the list.",
  "Lobster Mac|Thomas H. Handy Sazerac Rye": "Thomas H. Handy Sazerac Rye's rye-spice character leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the rye-and-oak weight handles the lobster mac, and the oak threads the cream. Works; cleaner than wheated versions but not exceptional.",
  "Lobster Mac|Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask": "Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight leans against the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the caramel-spice register matches the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Lobster Mac|Titos Vodka": "Titos Vodka's Texas-corn-workhorse neutrality finds neutral with the lobster mac's shellfish cream — the vodka neutrality sits with the plate, and the clean profile lets the cheese speak. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Lobster Mac|Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky": "Toki Suntory with lobster mac — entry Japanese blend against pasta-and-lobster richness. Works; Japanese whisky's delicate category handles the rich dish without fighting it.",
