  "Lobster Mac|Tullamore D.E.W.": "Tullamore D.E.W.'s gentle Irish blend finds neutral with the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the malt-grain blend handles the lobster mac, and the oak softens the cream. Works; a gentle, everyday match.",
