  "Lobster Mac|Weller Special Reserve": "Weller Special Reserve's wheated soft-vanilla character sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the bourbon depth settles into the lobster mac, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; bonded weight overpowers this dish.",
