  "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye|Chocolate Cake": "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye's rye-spice character leans against the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the rye-and-oak weight handles the chocolate cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; the richer pour finds more with the dessert than Original brings.",
  "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye|Clam Chowder": "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye's rye-spice character leans against the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the rye spice cuts the chowder, and the oak softens the cream. Works; Kentucky Owl is over-specified for a side — save the collector bottle for the main.",
  "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye|Cowboy Ribeye": "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye with the Cowboy Ribeye — premium sourced rye against cap fat. The boutique-blend character handles the ribeye at premium-sourced register. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
