  "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye|Faroe Island Salmon": "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye's rye-spice character swallows the salmon's rich oily flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a rye whiskey. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Lock Stock & Barrel Rye belongs on the steak course.",
