  "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye|French Onion": "Lock Stock & Barrel Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the rye backbone drives the French onion, and the dry-spice register brightens the bowl. Works; the call holds at register.",
