  "Macallan 18|Seafood Tower": "Macallan 18's premium aged 18yr Oloroso Speyside overshadows the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- the spirit weight crowds the delicate shellfish — no acid to clean the brine. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a scotch. Avoid; one of those is the move. Pour the Macallan 18 on the steak course instead.",
