  "Macallan 18|Seasonal Vegetables": "Macallan 18's premium aged 18yr Oloroso Speyside leans against the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the malt-and-oak threads the seasonal vegetables, and the oak-and-smoke underlines the side. Works; Voyage 23 handles the richness at ocean-finish register.",
