  "Macallan 18|Swordfish": "Macallan 18's premium aged 18yr Oloroso Speyside swallows the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory sear without a bridge. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a scotch. Avoid; the better calls are above. Hold the Macallan 18 for the steak course.",
