  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Asparagus": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character finds neutral with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the dry rye body wraps the asparagus, and the spice-and-vanilla thread softens the side. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character leans against the au gratin's cheese-and-cream golden crust: the high-rye spice register matches the au gratin, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; the bourbon's character is distinctive but the pairing isn't a standout.",
