  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Bone Marrow": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye with bone marrow — extended-aged Michigan rye against umami fat. The 16-year depth meets marrow with distinctive Michigan-distillery authority. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Bone-In Filet": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the rye spice cuts the bone-enhanced filet, and the rye edge frames the cut. Strong; multi-distillery complexity sits with richness at craft-blender register.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Broccoli Cheddar": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the rye spice cuts the broccoli cheddar, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; sweet character distinctive but not driving.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Broccolini": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character finds neutral with the broccolini's tender green stalks: the rye-and-oak weight handles the broccolini, and the rye edge frames the side. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Brussels and Belly": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye with Brussels + Belly — 16-year home-state rye meets maple-glazed pork belly. The extended maturation cuts the glaze with Michigan-distillery distinctiveness. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
