  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Carrot Cake": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the rye spice cuts the carrot cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Cheesecake": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character leans against the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the rye spice cuts the cheesecake, and the oak softens the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Chilean Seabass": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character overwhelms the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- bourbon weight needs red meat, not the salmon's already-rich oils. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a rye whiskey. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Reserve the Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye for the steak course.",
