  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Creme Brulee": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the dry rye body wraps the brulee, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; the spicy-sweet character gives the dessert a Barton frame.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Escargot": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's pepper-spice character sits with the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the whiskey weight reads cleanly against the umami plate, and the oak frames the umami. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
