  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Loaded Potato": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the rye-pepper edge sharpens the loaded potato soup, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
  "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye|Lobster Mac": "Mammoth 16 Year Single Barrel Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the rye-and-oak weight handles the lobster mac, and the oak threads the cream. Works; the pour's assertiveness is a bit much for the soup but doesn't clash.",
