  "Marc Brédif Chinon|French Onion": "Marc Brédif Chinon's herbaceous Cab Franc with red-fruit and bell-pepper reads alongside the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the Cab Franc body lifts the French onion, and the bell-pepper-and-cherry note frames the bowl. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
