  "Marc Brédif Chinon|Roast Half Chicken": "Loire Cab Franc — Chinon light body, raspberry, red cherry, bell pepper, forest floor, supple low tannin, bright high acid. The bright acid and bell pepper play against roasted chicken's skin-and-jus build; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Peak food wine for chicken — Chinon across most seasonal preparations.",
