  "Margarita|Burrata": "Corazon Blanco, lemon, lime, orange, Cointreau. The triple-citrus lift cuts burrata's cream and the blanco's agave-forward character adds dimension against basil-tomato; Cointreau softens the finish. Peak starter cocktail for burrata — classic citrus structure against soft cheese.",
