  "Margarita|Chocolate Brownie": "Margarita's blanco-and-citrus margarita brightness fights the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight -- citrus-cocktail brightness pulls against chocolate weight — no bridge between sour-sweet and rich-sweet. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Louis XIII Cognac, not a light cocktail. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Margarita lands on the steak course — not here.",
