  "Margarita|Filet Mignon": "Corazon Blanco, lemon, lime, orange, Cointreau — salted rim. The cocktail's triple-citrus profile is wrong for steak — bright citrus has no hook into grilled beef. Works only if guest stays on the Margarita; route filet pairing to Cab, Pinot, or Manhattan for peak.",
