  "Margarita|Gumbo": "Corazon Blanco, lemon, lime, orange, Cointreau. The triple-citrus lift cuts gumbo's dark-roux fat and the blanco's agave plays against Cajun spice. Works as tequila cocktail for gumbo — Gulf-Coast-adjacent citrus on the stew; structured reds peak higher.",
