  "Margarita|Prime Tartare": "Prime Tartare: this rich, umami-forward starter's bold fat and concentrated savory depth meets this bright tequila cocktail's citrus lift and agave backbone. Light cocktail's citrus lift mirrors a delicate starter's brightness. Strong — aligned lift.",
