  "Margarita|Shrimp Cocktail": "Corazon Blanco, lemon, lime, orange, Cointreau — salted rim. The triple-citrus cuts chilled shrimp's sweet brine and the salted rim plays against cocktail-sauce horseradish. Peak starter pairing — classic Margarita-with-shrimp logic delivered with a careful citrus build. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Margarita|Swordfish": "Margarita -- blanco tequila, lime, salt rim, patio classic, agave-citrus build. The agave-citrus body brightens the swordfish, and the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
