  "Marimar Estate Christina|Burrata": "Russian River Green Valley Pinot — ripe strawberry, cherry compote, warm spice, silky, low tannin. The silky structure meets burrata's creamy-delicate center and the strawberry plays against basil-tomato. Works as plush Pinot for burrata — Russian River opulence; whites and rosés peak higher.",
