  "Marimar Estate Christina|Chilean Seabass": "Marimar Estate Christina's silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift clashes with the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- tannin reads metallic against the fish's natural fats. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not an elegant red. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Reserve the Marimar Estate Christina for the steak course.",
  "Marimar Estate Christina|Chocolate Brownie": "Marimar Estate Christina's silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift clashes with the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight -- savory tannin sits awkwardly on cocoa weight without resolving. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Louis XIII Cognac, not an elegant red. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Marimar Estate Christina belongs on the steak course.",
