  "Market Fish|Yamazaki 18 Year": "Yamazaki 18 Year's aged Suntory mizunara character sits alongside the market fish's clean white-fish flesh: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the market fish, and the green-fruit edge brightens the plate. Works; the bonded richness gives the dessert more than lighter pours do.",
