  "Michter's 10 Year Bourbon|Asparagus": "Michter's 10 Year Bourbon's rounded-oak bourbon character reads alongside the asparagus' green-vegetal edge: the bourbon depth settles into the asparagus, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the side. Works; bonded weight pushes slightly past the soup.",
