  "Michter's 10 Year Bourbon|Broccolini": "Michter's 10 Year Bourbon's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone leans against the broccolini's tender green stalks: the brown-spirit warmth threads the broccolini, and the rounded sweetness brightens the side. Works; Old Fitz 9 brings more depth here.",
