  "Michter's 10 Year Rye|Broccoli Cheddar": "Michter's 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the rye spice cuts the broccoli cheddar, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
