  "Michter's 10 Year Rye|Brussels and Belly": "Michter's 10 Year Rye with Brussels + Belly — aged Michter's meets maple-glazed pork belly. The 10-year polish cuts the glaze with premium small-batch authority. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
