  "Michter's 10 Year Rye|Carrot Cake": "Michter's 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character reads alongside the carrot cake's cream-cheese-frosted spice cake: the rye-and-oak weight handles the carrot cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; Caribbean Cask handles the richness at distinctive register.",
  "Michter's 10 Year Rye|Cheesecake": "Michter's 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character sits alongside the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard: the rye-pepper edge sharpens the cheesecake, and the oak frames the rich cream. Works; premium rye gives the dessert substantial depth.",
