  "Milagro Anejo|Burrata": "Milagro Anejo's aged-agave character fights the burrata's fresh basil-tomato-cream delicacy -- agave and fresh dairy refuse each other texturally. The plate deserves Il Colle Prosecco Superiore, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, not an añejo tequila. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Milagro Anejo belongs on the steak course.",
