  "Milagro Anejo|Creme Brulee": "Milagro Anejo's barrel-aged tequila weight reads alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the brulee, and the cooked-agave note underlines the dessert. Works; the 70th's smoothness is an unusual but interesting counterpoint.",
