  "Milagro Anejo|Porterhouse": "Milagro Anejo's rested-agave body leans against the porterhouse's dual strip-and-filet character: the aged-agave weight wraps the dual-cut steak, and the cooked-agave note underlines the cut. Strong; modern cleanness is capable but the starter earns a more character-forward reposado.",
