  "Mocha Creme|Espresso Martini": "Tito's, espresso, Grind Espresso Liqueur, Averna amaro, vanilla syrup, Angostura. Coffee-on-coffee alignment — the cocktail's espresso and the Mocha Crème's espresso-pod build share a direct axis. Peak coffee-cocktail pour when the dessert returns; currently unavailable. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
