  "Mocha Creme|Far Niente Chardonnay": "Far Niente Chardonnay's estate Napa Chardonnay character clashes with the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- a dry white belongs with the main course, not the dessert close. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not a white wine. Avoid; one of those is the move. Far Niente Chardonnay lands on the steak course — not here.",
