  "Mocha Creme|Fento Ollo de Sapo Mencía": "Fento Ollo de Sapo Mencía's Tempranillo with vanilla-and-leather depth fights the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- the dry red and the chocolate's sugar refuse each other — tannin reads bitter on the finish. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not an elegant red. Avoid; the better calls are above. Reserve the Fento Ollo de Sapo Mencía for the steak course.",
