  "Mocha Creme|Green Chartreuse": "Green Chartreuse's cask-strength herbal-high-proof sweetness holds steady against the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate dessert — the sweet character mirrors the dessert sugar, and the herbs cut the cream. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
