  "Mocha Creme|Kahlua": "Kahlua: Mexican rum-base coffee liqueur (since 1936, Diageo-owned), Arabica-coffee-vanilla-caramel at 20% ABV. Excellent on mocha creme; the iconic sweet-coffee-rum profile threads coffee-chocolate at workhorse register — Kahlua-on-mocha is textbook. Gold standard; the recommendation that earns the regular.",
