  "Mocha Creme|Louis XIII Cognac": "Louis XIII Cognac's luxury-icon cognac depth sits alongside the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness: the icon-cognac register elevates the mocha creme, and the polished oak softens the dessert. Works; the side is not the place to pour Louis XIII — the bottle demands main-course or sipping-alone attention.",
