  "Mocha Creme|Macallan Estate": "Macallan Estate with mocha creme — Estate-grown-oak Macallan against coffee-chocolate dessert. Works; Macallan Estate's distinctive character threads the mocha at premium register.",
  "Mocha Creme|Macauley Petite Syrah": "Macauley Petite Syrah's spice-and-dark-fruit Rhone register jars against the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate richness -- savory tannin meets dessert sugar with no bridge between them. The plate deserves Kahlua, Patron XO Cafe, or Frangelico, not an elegant red. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Save the Macauley Petite Syrah for the steak course.",
