  "Mushroom Bisque|Jameson Irish Whiskey": "Jameson Irish Whiskey's classic Irish blend smoothness leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the smooth triple-distilled register matches the mushroom bisque, and the oak underlines the umami weight. Works; Fortuna's NZ terroir meets the glaze at distinctive register.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir": "Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin sits beside the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the medium-body red frames the hearty soup, and the cherry-fruit rounds the cream. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis": "Burgundy Chablis — lean flint-chalk precision, green apple, citrus. The flinty mineral plays against the bisque's mushroom umami and the high acid cuts the silky cream. Peak Chablis for mushroom bisque — Burgundian mineral on earth-and-cream. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jefferson's Ocean Marian McLain L.E.": "Jefferson's Ocean Marian McLain L.E.'s warm-vanilla bourbon backbone leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the bourbon depth settles into the mushroom bisque, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; complexity wasted on salad.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jefferson's Ocean Voyage 23": "Jefferson's Ocean Voyage 23's caramel-and-spice bourbon weight finds neutral with the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the mushroom bisque, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jefferson's Reserve": "Jefferson's Reserve's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth sits alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the brown-spirit warmth threads the mushroom bisque, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; own-plus-sourced covers both cuts without standing out.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak": "Jefferson's Reserve VR Twin Oak's grain-and-oak bourbon register sits alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the bourbon depth settles into the mushroom bisque, and the vanilla lifts the cream. Works; multi-distillery complexity doesn't drive.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jim Beam Black Label": "Jim Beam Black Label's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the bourbon backbone carries the mushroom bisque, and the vanilla rounds the cream. Works; the toast adds a warmth the dessert can accept.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jim Beam White Label": "Jim Beam White Label's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the bourbon depth settles into the mushroom bisque, and the rounded sweetness brightens the cream. Works; AE's fruity-jammy character engages the bleu at wine-finish register.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Johnnie Walker Black": "Johnnie Walker Black's Highland-scotch character sits alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the scotch backbone matches the mushroom bisque, and the oak underlines the umami weight. Works; boutique over-specified.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Johnnie Walker Blue": "Johnnie Walker Blue's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the malt-and-oak threads the mushroom bisque, and the oak depth meets the umami. Works; wine-cask complexity gives the dessert layered premium character.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Johnnie Walker Red": "Johnnie Walker Red's Highland-scotch character reads alongside the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the scotch backbone matches the mushroom bisque, and the oak balances the umami register. Works; the 80-proof softness doesn't overshoot the salad the way heavier bourbons do.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon": "Sonoma Cab — cassis, plum, cedar, mint, fine tannin, elegant balance. The cedar plays against the bisque's mushroom earth but the fine tannin reads firmer than a cream soup needs. Works tier on this wine's card — solid fit for Mushroom Bisque but below the wine's peaks with the Tomahawk, Porterhouse, and Bone-In Filet.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Joseph Mellot Sancerre": "Joseph Mellot Sancerre's crisp citrus-mineral acidity reads alongside the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the crisp acidity sits with the plate, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
