  "Mushroom Bisque|Jung and Wulff Guyana": "Jung and Wulff Guyana's rich layered-spirit body finds neutral with the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the layered spirit body sits with the mushroom bisque, and the layered body brightens the bowl. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Jung and Wulff Trinidad": "Jung and Wulff Trinidad's rich layered-spirit body leans against the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream: the layered spirit body sits with the mushroom bisque, and the dense weight underlines the bowl. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "Mushroom Bisque|Kahlua": "Kahlua's sweet liqueur character clashes with the mushroom bisque's silky earthy mushroom cream -- the soup-salad course needs lift or acid — sweet liqueur brings neither. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Keenan Chardonnay, or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a digestif. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Hold the Kahlua for the steak course.",
