  "Mushrooms|Bowdie's Old Fashioned": "Buffalo Trace muddled with rum-infused cherries, orange, bitters. The vanilla-caramel meets the mushroom side's earthy butter-sauté richness; brûléed-orange nose adds aromatic lift. Strong pairing — the bourbon handles mushroom depth without the clash a lighter cocktail might bring.",
