  "Mushrooms|Macauley Petite Syrah": "Napa Petite Sirah — Macauley, inky color, dense powerful tannin (not Syrah), blackberry, blueberry, dark chocolate, black pepper, full body. The black pepper plays with roasted-mushroom butter, though the dense tannin reads aggressive for earth-glutamate. Strong Petite-Sirah for mushrooms — a Rhône garrigue fits softer.",
