  "Mushrooms|Maker's Mark Cellar Aged": "Maker's Mark Cellar Aged with the mushrooms — aged caramel and vanilla against umami. The cellar-aged depth complements mushroom weight; a sophisticated Maker's interpretation of this side. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
