  "Mushrooms|Monkey Shoulder": "Monkey Shoulder with mushrooms — triple-Speyside-malt blend against earthy umami. Excellent; Monkey Shoulder's Glenfiddich-Balvenie-Kininvie Speyside-malt base threads mushroom earthiness with fruit-and-vanilla character.",
