  "Mushrooms|Muga Reserva": "Rioja Alta Reserva Tempranillo-blend — Muga, American-French oak, strawberry, dried cherry, vanilla, leather, savory-earthy. The savory-earthy finish echoes roasted-mushroom glutamate and the vanilla-oak plays with butter. Peak Rioja for mushrooms — traditional-oak plus earth harmony. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
