  "Mushrooms|Myers's Rum": "Myers's Rum's bold molasses-Jamaican character finds register with the mushrooms' earthy umami — the whiskey depth meets the indulgent side. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Mushrooms|Negroni": "Gin, Contratto, Campari. The Campari's bitter-orange and Contratto's herbal complexity meet the mushroom side's earthy butter-sauté directly; the cocktail's structure handles the side's depth. Strong pairing — the Negroni's edge plays against mushroom umami well.",
