  "Mushrooms|New Holland Beer Barrel Bourbon": "New Holland Beer Barrel Bourbon with mushrooms — beer-barrel-finished MI bourbon against earthy umami. Strong; NH Beer Barrel's hop-character threads mushrooms at Michigan-hometown register.",
