  "Mushrooms|Not a Paper Plane": "Bulleit bourbon, Nonino Quintessential, Aperol, Angostura — stirred. Nonino's herbal complexity meets the mushroom side's earthy butter-sauté directly and Aperol's orange adds aromatic lift. Strong pairing — the cocktail's bittersweet structure plays beautifully against mushroom umami.",
