  "Mushrooms|Shafer 1.5": "Mushrooms: Cab tannin frames the earthy mushroom-and-truffle depth; dark fruit lifts the umami into the wine's body. A headliner pair — pour confidently. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Mushrooms|Shafer Hillside Select": "Stags Leap collector's Cab — Hillside Select 32-month French oak, blackcurrant, dark chocolate, violet, graphite, dense yet silky, firm tannin. The graphite echoes roasted-mushroom glutamate and the violet plays against the earth depth. Strong collector's Napa Cab for mushrooms — Hillside Select extraordinary length on the earthy side.",
