  "Mushrooms|Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask": "Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask with mushrooms — Barton chardonnay-cask against earthy umami. Strong; TSM Chardonnay Cask's chardonnay-butter threads mushroom earthiness with distinctive white-wine character.",
  "Mushrooms|Titos Vodka": "Titos Vodka's Texas-corn-workhorse neutrality leans against the mushrooms' earthy umami — the vodka neutrality sits with the plate. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
