  "Mushrooms|Tomato Basil": "Tomato Basil and the mushrooms -- the tomato basil's bright tomato-basil acid meets the mushrooms' earthy umami weight: the bright register pulls against the savory, the contrast lands. Works; no conflict however the table orders them.",
  "Mushrooms|Transfusion": "Transfusion's crisp citrus-ginger build plays cleanly against the mushrooms' earthy umami — the cocktail lift cleans the rich side, and the botanicals frame the umami depth. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Mushrooms|Trombo Cedano Reposado": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the mushrooms — cedar-wood reposado against earthy umami. Strong; cedar and mushroom share forest-floor territory — a distinctive side pairing.",
