  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Bone Marrow": "Never Say Die Small Batch with bone marrow — novelty UK-aged against umami fat. The distinctive maturation gives the starter a conversation angle that standard bourbons don't bring. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Bone-In Filet": "Never Say Die Small Batch's caramel-vanilla character matches the bone-in filet's marrow-edged tenderness — the bourbon depth supports the lean cut without overpowering, and the vanilla softens the grilled char. Strong; the match carries without overshooting.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Broccoli Cheddar": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth leans against the broccoli cheddar's cheddar-and-broccoli cream: the bourbon body sits with the broccoli cheddar, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; Discovery complexity wasted on salad simplicity.",
