  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Brussels and Belly": "Never Say Die Small Batch with Brussels + Belly — Yorkshire-aged Kentucky bourbon meets maple-glazed pork belly. The distinctive maturation story is the draw; a conversation-starter small-plate pour. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Burrata": "Never Say Die Small Batch with burrata — fresh dairy against novelty bourbon. Avoid; redirect the order to a more aligned pour.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Butternut Squash": "Never Say Die Small Batch's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone sits alongside the butternut squash's silky sweet squash cream: the bourbon body sits with the squash bisque, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; no driver pairing.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Carrot Cake": "Never Say Die Small Batch with carrot cake — UK-aged novelty against cream cheese and cinnamon. The distinctive cask character picks up the cake's complexity; a unique dessert pairing that leans into the bourbon's story. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Cheesecake": "Never Say Die Small Batch with cheesecake — novelty bourbon against clean custard. Works; the unique maturation story adds interest to a gentle dessert match.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Chilean Seabass": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- bourbon weight needs red meat, not the salmon's already-rich oils. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Never Say Die Small Batch belongs on the steak course.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Chocolate Brownie": "Never Say Die Small Batch with the chocolate brownie — UK-aged against cocoa. Works; for cocoa interplay, Weller 107 or Basil Hayden's Toast are the firmer calls, but Never Say Die's cask character is worth noting.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Chocolate Cake": "Never Say Die Small Batch's spice-and-caramel bourbon depth sits alongside the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the bourbon depth settles into the chocolate cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Clam Chowder": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth sits alongside the chowder's creamy clam-and-potato base: the bourbon backbone carries the chowder, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Cowboy Ribeye": "Never Say Die Small Batch with the Cowboy Ribeye — UK-aged Kentucky against cap fat. Strong; the distinctive character is more about the story than the pairing — Weller 12 or Knob Creek are firmer ribeye calls, but Never Say Die is the conversation pour.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Crab Cake": "Never Say Die Small Batch with crab cake — novelty bourbon against delicate crab. Avoid; pour a white wine.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Creamed Spinach": "Never Say Die Small Batch with creamed spinach — UK-matured bourbon against dairy. Strong; distinctive cask character adds dimension standard bourbons don't bring.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Creamy Potato": "Never Say Die Small Batch's rounded-oak bourbon character finds neutral with the potato soup's silky-bodied cream: the caramel-spice register matches the potato soup, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; the pour's brightness is a gentle counterpoint to the dessert's richness.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Creme Brulee": "Never Say Die Small Batch's rounded-oak bourbon character reads alongside the brulee's burnt-sugar custard: the bourbon backbone carries the brulee, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; distinctive character doesn't drive but adds interest.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Escargot": "Never Say Die Small Batch's caramel-vanilla character lifts the escargot's garlic-herb butter — the bourbon depth cuts the umami fat, and the caramel rounds the umami plate. Strong; a confident match across the table.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Faroe Island Salmon": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the salmon's rich oily flesh -- bourbon depth belongs with red meat, not a flaky main. The plate deserves Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Elk Cove Five Mountain, not a bourbon. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Reserve the Never Say Die Small Batch for the steak course.",
  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Filet Mignon": "Never Say Die Small Batch with the filet — Kentucky bourbon aged in Yorkshire, UK. Distinctive cask influence from maritime climate; a novelty release with a genuinely unique maturation story. A character-driven conversation pour for the filet; the story is the draw. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
