  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Loaded Potato": "Never Say Die Small Batch's grain-and-oak bourbon register finds neutral with the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the bourbon body sits with the loaded potato soup, and the vanilla underlines the rich cream. Works; the pour's complexity is underused by the salad.",
