  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Market Fish": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth smothers the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- the brown-spirit weight pulls focus off the delicate fish protein. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a bourbon. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Pour the Never Say Die Small Batch on the steak course instead.",
