  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Rainbow Trout": "Never Say Die Small Batch's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth swallows the trout's delicate flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bourbon. Avoid; the better calls are above. Save the Never Say Die Small Batch for the steak course.",
