  "Never Say Die Small Batch|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Never Say Die Small Batch's soft-oak bourbon body reads alongside the chickpea soup's roasted-pepper chickpea warmth: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the chickpea soup, and the rounded sweetness brightens the bowl. Works; boutique character gives the dessert a craft frame.",
