  "Not a Paper Plane|Market Fish": "Not a Paper Plane's citrus-herbal build sits with the fish's clean flesh — the cocktail lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Mocha Creme": "Not a Paper Plane's citrus-herbal build sits beside the mocha creme's coffee-chocolate dessert — the cocktail acidity underclubs the dessert, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Mushroom Bisque": "Not a Paper Plane's citrus-herbal build plays cleanly against the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the cocktail lift refreshes against the hearty soup, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; the pairing holds without overshooting.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Mushrooms": "Bulleit bourbon, Nonino Quintessential, Aperol, Angostura — stirred. Nonino's herbal complexity meets the mushroom side's earthy butter-sauté directly and Aperol's orange adds aromatic lift. Strong pairing — the cocktail's bittersweet structure plays beautifully against mushroom umami.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Not a Paper Plane's citrus-herbal build reads alongside the PB brownie's peanut-cocoa stack — the cocktail acidity underclubs the dessert, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Porterhouse": "Bulleit bourbon, Nonino Quintessential, Aperol, Angostura. The cocktail's bourbon-and-amaro depth handles the Porterhouse's dual-cut nature; Nonino's bitterness cuts the strip's char and Aperol plays against the filet's delicacy. Strong spirit-forward pour for the house showcase cut.",
  "Not a Paper Plane|Prime Tartare": "Bulleit bourbon, Nonino amaro, Aperol, Angostura — stirred. The cocktail's bourbon weight and Nonino's herbal bitterness cut raw prime beef's iron richness; Aperol adds aromatic orange complexity. Peak amaro-forward pre-dinner pairing for hand-cut beef — sophistication meets sophistication.",
