  "Old Emmer|Brussels and Belly": "Old Emmer's rounded-oak bourbon character leans against Brussels + Belly's maple-pork-belly glaze over charred sprouts: the bourbon weight handles the pork-belly plate, and the vanilla brightens the grilled char-edge. Works; distinctive character gives the dessert a unique story-frame; Fernet Branca still cuts it harder.",
