  "Old Emmer|Chocolate Brownie": "Old Emmer with the chocolate brownie — emmer-wheat wheated bourbon against cocoa. Excellent; wheated bourbon + chocolate is the category-featured dessert pairing, and Old Emmer brings it with ancient-grain craft distinction.",
  "Old Emmer|Chocolate Cake": "Old Emmer's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth reads alongside the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body: the bourbon weight handles the chocolate cake, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; the 80-proof softness doesn't overshoot the salad the way heavier bourbons do.",
