  "Old Emmer|Cowboy Ribeye": "Old Emmer with the cowboy ribeye — emmer-wheat wheated bourbon against 26oz bone-in cap-fat. Excellent; Old Emmer's ancient-grain softness + wheated depth handles cap-fat intensity at craft register.",
