  "Peanut Butter Brownie|Elijah Craig Small Batch": "Elijah Craig Small Batch's rounded-oak bourbon character finds neutral with the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the brown-spirit warmth threads the PB brownie, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; Parker's Heritage 16th handles the richness at annual-release register.",
