  "Peanut Butter Brownie|Long Road Gin": "Long Road Gin's botanical-driven lift clashes with the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge -- gin's botanical-citrus register fights dessert sweetness without a bridge. The plate deserves Frangelico, Disaronno, or Graham's 20 Year Tawny, not a gin. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Reserve the Long Road Gin for the steak course.",
