  "Peanut Butter Brownie|Shrimp Bisque": "The shrimp bisque and the PB brownie -- the shrimp bisque's creamy shellfish soup bookends with the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge. Works; no flavor conflict across the meal, either as opener-close or together.",
