  "Peanut Butter Brownie|Weller Special Reserve": "Weller Special Reserve's wheated soft-vanilla character leans against the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the brown-spirit warmth threads the PB brownie, and the spice threads the dessert. Works; Caribbean Cask handles the richness at distinctive register.",
  "Peanut Butter Brownie|Wheatley Vodka": "Wheatley Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge -- vodka brings no flavor to bridge the chocolate's weight — neutral but wrong for the close. The plate deserves Frangelico, Disaronno, or Graham's 20 Year Tawny, not a vodka. Avoid; the better calls are above. Save the Wheatley Vodka for the steak course.",
