  "Rainbow Trout|Balvenie 12 American Oak": "Balvenie 12 American Oak's bourbon-cask Speyside softness swallows the trout's delicate flesh -- the sweet-spirit register fights the savory main without a bridge. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a scotch. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Balvenie 12 American Oak lands on the steak course — not here.",
