  "Rainbow Trout|Bardstown Foursquare": "Bardstown Foursquare's rum-cask + cocoa is textbook — tropical-rum + chocolate smothers the trout's delicate flesh -- the brown-spirit weight pulls focus off the delicate fish protein. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bourbon. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Save the Bardstown Foursquare for the steak course.",
