  "Rainbow Trout|Bee's Knees": "Bee's Knees's crisp butter-citrus build reads alongside the trout's delicate flesh — the cocktail lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; the match carries without overshooting.",
  "Rainbow Trout|Beefeater Gin": "Beefeater Gin's London-Dry-juniper botanicals finds register with the trout's delicate flesh — the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly, and the botanicals lift the savory weight. Strong; the call holds at register without strain.",
  "Rainbow Trout|Beignets": "After the trout, the beignets -- the delicate flesh yields to warm choux and powdered sugar, the dipping sauce closing light. Strong; the lighter main and the light close share register, the meal stays composed.",
  "Rainbow Trout|Belvedere Vodka": "Belvedere Vodka -- Polish rye-based vodka, premium clean-slightly-sweet profile. The unflavored body sits with the trout, and the crisp profile carries the plate. Strong; Belvedere's character is distinctive but Goose's softness is the flagship tower choice.",
