  "Rainbow Trout|Cade Cabernet Sauvignon": "Cade Cabernet Sauvignon's Howell Mountain Cab character clashes with the trout's delicate flesh -- tannin reads metallic against the fish's natural fats. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not an elegant red. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Save the Cade Cabernet Sauvignon for the steak course.",
