  "Rainbow Trout|Campari": "Campari's aperitivo at its most textbook overwhelms the trout's delicate flesh -- bitter herbs flatten delicate fish — the protein can't lift the amaro's register. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; reach for any of those instead. Save the Campari for the steak course.",
