  "Rainbow Trout|Carrot Cake": "The trout into the carrot cake -- the lemon-finished delicate flesh hands off to spiced cake and cream-cheese frosting, walnut crunch on the close. Works; the lighter main yields to the spiced close, the meal arcs cleanly.",
