  "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve|Prime Tartare": "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve's bold cherry-juniper character sits with the tartare's raw beef and brine — the whiskey weight reads cleanly against the umami plate, and the caramel meets the nut character. Strong; a steady recommendation at the table.",
  "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve|Rainbow Trout": "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth overwhelms the trout's delicate flesh -- bourbon depth belongs with red meat, not a flaky main. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a bourbon. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve belongs on the steak course.",
  "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve|Roast Half Chicken": "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth sits alongside the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast: the caramel-spice register matches the roast chicken, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the plate. Works; EHT Full Proof handles the richness at historic Kentucky register.",
