  "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Remus 15 Year Gatsby Reserve's soft-oak bourbon body reads alongside the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the bourbon body sits with the curry, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the bowl. Works; the single-barrel depth is over-specified for this dish.",
  "Remy VSOP Cognac|Asparagus": "Remy VSOP Cognac's VSOP fine-champagne cognac clashes with the asparagus' green-vegetal edge -- cognac on a savory side is wrong-course energy. The plate deserves Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, Joseph Mellot Sancerre, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a cognac. Avoid; the alts above are the call. Remy VSOP Cognac lands on the steak course — not here.",
