  "Remy VSOP Cognac|Broccolini": "Remy VSOP Cognac's VSOP fine-champagne cognac clashes with the broccolini's tender green stalks -- cognac on a green vegetable side is wrong direction — needs crisp white instead. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Domaine de Berthiers Pouilly-Fumé, not a cognac. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Save the Remy VSOP Cognac for the steak course.",
