  "Remy VSOP Cognac|Chilean Seabass": "Remy VSOP Cognac's VSOP fine-champagne cognac clashes with the seabass' buttery seabass flesh -- cognac is post-meal energy — wrong register for a main protein. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Pommery Cuvée Louise, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a cognac. Avoid; the listed alts pair where this does not. Reserve the Remy VSOP Cognac for the steak course.",
