  "Remy VSOP Cognac|Cowboy Ribeye": "Remy VSOP Cognac's cognac-fruit character finds register with the ribeye's cap fat and char — the barrel-aged depth meets the cap-fat, and the cassis plays against the grilled char. Strong; a steady recommendation at the table.",
