  "Rey Sol Anejo|Bone Marrow": "Rey Sol Anejo with bone marrow — Moorish-inspired aged tequila against umami fat. The distinctive-packaging extra añejo meets marrow with ceremonial presentation. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
