  "Reyka Vodka|Chocolate Brownie": "Reyka Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the brownie's fudgy cocoa-and-chocolate weight -- vodka brings no flavor to bridge the chocolate's weight — neutral but wrong for the close. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Louis XIII Cognac, not a vodka. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Reyka Vodka lands on the steak course — not here.",
  "Reyka Vodka|Chocolate Cake": "Reyka Vodka's crystalline neutrality falls short of the chocolate cake's layered chocolate body -- vodka brings no anchor — the dessert needs a flavor partner, not a clean spirit. The plate deserves Taylor Fladgate Vintage Bottle, Graham's 2017 Vintage Port, or Baileys Irish Cream, not a vodka. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Hold the Reyka Vodka for the steak course.",
