  "Roast Half Chicken|Averna Amaro": "Averna Amaro's bitter-herb aperitivo edge clashes with the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast -- bitter aperitivo is for before or after the meal — not on a main protein. The plate deserves Keenan Chardonnay, Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, or Alexander Valley Chardonnay, not a bitter aperitivo. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Hold the Averna Amaro for the steak course.",
