  "Roast Half Chicken|Burrata": "The chicken after the burrata -- the herbed crisp skin sits cleanly with the basil-tomato burrata. Strong; the starter composes cleanly before the main.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Butternut Squash": "Roast Half Chicken after the butternut squash -- the silky sweet squash cream opens with autumnal warmth, the chicken following with herbed crisp-skin roast that the squash's sweetness echoes cleanly. Strong; autumn into autumn reads complete.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Cade Cabernet Sauvignon": "Cade Cabernet Sauvignon's Howell Mountain Cab character reads alongside the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast: the Howell-Mountain Cab tannin frames the roast chicken, and the cassis grips the plate. Works; the call holds at register.",
