  "Roast Half Chicken|Chambord": "Chambord's sweet liqueur character buries the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast -- sugar smothers the chicken's savory frame — wait for dessert. The plate deserves Keenan Chardonnay, Cristom Mt Jefferson Cuvée, or Alexander Valley Chardonnay, not a digestif. Avoid; redirect the order — the alternatives carry it. Reserve the Chambord for the steak course.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Cheesecake": "The chicken closes with the cheesecake -- the herbed roast hands off to dense cream-cheese custard on graham crust, berry compote brightening the close. Works; the meal builds toward sweetness without crowding either course.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Chocolate Brownie": "The chicken closes with the warm fudge brownie -- the jus-finished bird gives way to dense cocoa fudge, warm vanilla over the top. Works; the herbed bird and the substantial brownie share the meal cleanly.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Chocolate Cake": "After the chicken, the chocolate cake -- the herbed crisp-skin roast hands off to layered cocoa-and-ganache, the vanilla scoop tying the close. Works; the comfort-classic main yields to the comfort-classic dessert without strain.",
