  "Roast Half Chicken|Christian Bros Brandy": "Christian Bros Brandy's aged-grape brandy depth reads alongside the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast: the cognac register matches the roast chicken, and the caramel rounds the plate. Works; Rémy's refinement is over-specified for the casual dessert.",
