  "Roast Half Chicken|Daniel Chotard Sancerre Rouge": "Sancerre Rouge — Loire red Pinot, raspberry, chalk, dried herbs, light body. The dried-herbs play against roasted chicken's skin-and-jus build; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Strong Loire Pinot for chicken across most seasonal preparations.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Darioush Cabernet Franc": "Mount Veeder Napa Cab Franc (rare) — Darioush elegant aromatic, violet, dark cherry, dried rose, savory herb, medium tannin, medium body. The medium body handles chicken's skin-and-jus build; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Works as rare-Napa CF for chicken across most seasonal preparations.",
