  "Roast Half Chicken|Elk Cove Five Mountain": "Chehalem Mountains Willamette Pinot — cherry, violet, clove, structured backbone. The clove-spice plays against roasted chicken's skin-and-jus build; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Peak step-up Willamette Pinot for chicken across most preparations. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
