  "Roast Half Chicken|RAEN Royal St Robert": "Fort Ross-Seaview Sonoma Coast Pinot — sea-influenced, red cherry, cranberry, wild strawberry, crushed rock, silky. The elegant frame plays against roasted chicken's skin-and-jus build; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Strong Burgundian California Pinot for chicken.",
