  "Roast Half Chicken|Redbreast 21 Year": "Redbreast 21 with the chicken — 21-year aged pot still Irish against roasted poultry. Excellent; Redbreast 21's aged depth frames chicken at collector register — the most premium Irish-chicken pairing in the cluster.",
