  "Roast Half Chicken|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Roast Half Chicken after the chickpea soup -- the roasted-pepper warmth opens with smoky-sweet lift, the chicken following with herbed crisp-skin roast the soup's char primed in matching register. Strong; roast into roast reads coherent.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs": "Le Mesnil Grand Cru blanc de blancs — chalky minerality, lemon curd, green apple, no dosage. The austere precision handles roasted chicken; preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen for today's build. Works across most seasonal chicken builds as a precise sommelier Champagne option.",
