  "Roast Half Chicken|The BG": "The BG: this bold whiskey-forward cocktail's oak, spice, and spirit depth meets this roasted chicken's savory, rich poultry-skin flavor. Bold whiskey against roasted chicken — the drink outweighs but oak and savory can mesh. Strong — aligned depth.",
  "Roast Half Chicken|The Happy Wife": "Tito's, orange juice, ginger syrup. The orange-and-ginger profile can handle roasted chicken well, though seasonal accompaniments drive the pairing — check with kitchen. Peak approachable cocktail option for chicken when guest wants something simple and pleasant.",
