  "Roast Half Chicken|Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask": "Thomas S. Moore Chardonnay Cask's grain-and-oak bourbon register reads alongside the chicken's herbed crisp-skin roast: the brown-spirit warmth threads the roast chicken, and the oak-and-spice register settles the plate. Works; rich vanilla and high-proof give the dessert bolder match than standard Beam brings.",
