  "Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea|Evening Land Seven Springs": "Willamette Pinot — savory Eola-Amity Pinot, medium tannin, elegant delicate. The savory edge plays against the soup's smoky chickpea base and the medium tannin meets roasted-pepper sweetness. Works tier on this wine's card — solid fit for Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea but below the wine's peaks with duck, lamb, and mushroom-sauced proteins.",
