  "Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs|Escargot": "Le Mesnil Grand Cru Chardonnay — chalky minerality, lemon curd, green apple, no dosage. The austere precision cuts escargot's garlic-parsley butter and the chalk-mineral echoes French terroir tradition directly. Peak sommelier Champagne for escargot — technical match from the same soil. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
