  "Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs|Filet Mignon": "Le Mesnil Grand Cru blanc de blancs — chalky minerality, lemon curd, green apple, no dosage. The austere precision handles butter-tender filet's lean sweetness unconventionally; the chalk-mineral echoes escargot-butter toppers. Strong Champagne-with-steak when guest wants the sommelier's bottle over classic Cab.",
