  "Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs|Kansas City": "Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs' bright sparkling effervescence underclubs the KC's lean-bold strip with savory grain -- sparkling sits short of the prime cut's weight. The plate deserves Jordan Cabernet Sauvignon, Pio Cesare Barbaresco, or Pappy Van Winkle 13 Year Rye, not a sparkling. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Save the Robert Moncuit Les Grand Blancs for another course.",
