  "Ron Zacapa Rum|Seafood Tower": "Ron Zacapa Rum's Solera-honey premium-sipping rum overwhelms the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- the spirit's weight is too forward for the opening course. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a heavy spirit. Avoid; the better calls are above. Ron Zacapa Rum lands on the steak course — not here.",
