  "Russell's Reserve 10 Year|Seasonal Vegetables": "Russell's Reserve 10 Year's rounded-oak bourbon character finds neutral with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the bourbon depth settles into the seasonal vegetables, and the vanilla softens the side. Works; extended-aged premium wasted on salad simplicity.",
