  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Bombay Sapphire Gin": "Bombay Sapphire Gin's crisp London-Dry-citrus botanicals plays cleanly against the halibut's salt-cured flesh — the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
