  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Bowdie's Old Fashioned": "Buffalo Trace Old Fashioned against salt-cured halibut with sweet soy glaze — bourbon vanilla-caramel has no hook into cured fish and soy-glaze delicacy. Never layer. Route the cocktail to fatted steaks or marrow; take halibut with Chardonnay, Chablis, or Pinot Blanc.",
