  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Buffalo Trace Cream": "Buffalo Trace Cream's sweet liqueur character smothers the halibut's salt-cured flesh -- the liqueur's sweet register buries the gentle flesh's lift. The plate deserves Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Far Niente Chardonnay, not a digestif. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Pour the Buffalo Trace Cream on the steak course instead.",
