  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Creme Brulee": "After the halibut, the brulee -- the cured firm flesh yields to vanilla-bean custard and torched-sugar crust, berries lifting the close. Strong; the salt-cured depth meets the silky-classic finish at register.",
