  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Cucumber Gimlet": "Hendrick's, cucumber, lime, ginger syrup, soda. The ginger and cucumber echo Asian-soy-glaze character and the citrus lifts halibut's cured flesh. Works as gin cocktail for salt-cured halibut — fusion-adjacent route; wines peak higher as dedicated pairings.",
