  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir": "Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin sits alongside the halibut's salt-cured flesh — the silken tannin frames the fish, and the cherry-fruit lifts the herb edge. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis": "Burgundy Chablis — lean flint-chalk precision, green apple, citrus. The flinty mineral lifts halibut's firm flesh and the high acid cuts through the sweet soy glaze. Peak Chablis for salt-cured halibut — Burgundian precision on the cured classic. Gold standard; the recommendation that earns the regular.",
