  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Ketel One Vodka": "Ketel One Vodka's neutral vodka register leans against the halibut's salt-cured flesh: the unflavored body sits with the halibut, and the crisp profile carries the plate. Strong; Ketel handles the tower cleanly, though Goose's luxury softness wins the flagship pairing.",
  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Knickerbocker Gin": "Knickerbocker Gin's juniper-and-citrus lift sits alongside the halibut's salt-cured flesh: the floral edge frames the halibut, and the juniper threads the plate. Strong; Neptunia's briny character engages the bleu with distinctive maritime profile.",
