  "Salt-Cured Halibut|Los Vecinos Mezcal": "Los Vecinos Mezcal's smoky agave character overwhelms the halibut's salt-cured flesh -- mezcal smoke is wrong register for the main fish course. The plate deserves Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, or Far Niente Chardonnay, not a mezcal. Avoid; one of those is the move. Pour the Los Vecinos Mezcal on the steak course instead.",
