  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|Bone-In Filet": "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir's silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift leans against the bone-in filet's bone-enhanced buttery tenderness: the Pinot body brightens the bone-enhanced filet, and the cherry-and-earth note frames the cut. Strong; reliable opener for the cut.",
