  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|Cheesecake": "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir's silky Pinot Noir with cherry-and-forest-floor lift jars against the cheesecake's dense tangy dairy custard -- savory tannin meets dessert sugar with no bridge between them. The plate deserves Sauternes Glass, Vin Santo, or Disaronno, not an elegant red. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir lands on the steak course — not here.",
