  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|The Tomahawk": "Santa Barbara Pinot against Tomahawk's massive bone-in ribeye — layered Sta. Rita Hills Pinot's medium tannin still falls short of the cut's fat-and-char. Never pair. Route Tomahawk to Napa Cabs, Bordeaux, Meritage, or bold Italian reds; keep Sanford & Benedict for filet, salmon, or tartare.",
