  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|Truffle Fries": "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin stays alongside the truffle fries' Parmesan-and-truffle salt — the medium-body red sits with the rich side, and the cherry-fruit frames the umami depth. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin sits alongside the tuna's seared rare crust — the silken tannin frames the fish, and the cherry-fruit cuts the char. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Sanford & Benedict Pinot Noir's cherry-earth tannin sits beside the curry's spiced chickpea warmth — the medium-body red meets the light soup. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
