  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Belvedere Vodka": "Belvedere Vodka's bold Polish-rye-clean neutrality leans against the garlic-spinach's buttered greens — the neutral profile sits with the light side, and the clean profile carries the herb butter. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
