  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Jax Calesa Vineyard Pinot Noir": "Russian River Pinot — red cherry, pomegranate, subtle earth, balanced acidity. The acid cuts the sauté butter and the subtle earth plays against garlic without clashing with spinach earth. Works as food-friendly Pinot for the sauté side — reliable Russian River rounds the pairing.",
