  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Kansas City": "Kansas City with the garlic spinach -- the 18oz strip meets the wilted garlic-buttered greens, garlic accenting the strip's beefy register cleanly. Strong; lighter than the creamed pairing, just as honest.",
