  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Keenan Mernet": "Keenan Mernet's bold cherry-earth cassis plays cleanly against the garlic-spinach's buttered greens — the opulent body overshoots the light side, and the cherry-fruit rounds the cream. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye": "Kentucky Owl 10 Year Rye's rye-spice character finds neutral with the garlic spinach's garlic-buttered greens: the high-rye spice register matches the garlic spinach, and the rye-grain bite cuts the side. Works; BIB structure overshoots the dessert's delicacy.",
