  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Kermit Lynch Côtes du Rhône": "Rhône Valley Côtes du Rhône Grenache-Syrah-Mourvèdre — Kermit Lynch, red cherry, wild herbs, pepper, garrigue, medium body. The wild herbs echo garlic-oil aromatics and the medium body matches spinach-iron. Strong Southern-French for garlic spinach — Rhône herb-on-herb harmony.",
