  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Le Garenne Rosé": "Loire rosé — Pinot Noir with strawberry, watermelon, floral, crisp dry. The fresh-fruit acid cuts the sauté butter and the berry-floral plays against garlic without clashing with spinach's earth. Works as summer rosé for the sauté side — seasonal lightness on a simple side.",
