  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Licor 43": "Licor 43's sweet liqueur character clashes with the garlic spinach's garlic-buttered greens -- sugar on a clean vegetable side is wrong direction — needs herb-acid lift, not sweetness. The plate deserves Keenan Chardonnay, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Evening Land Seven Springs, not a digestif. Avoid; the better calls are above. Licor 43 belongs on the steak course.",
