  "Sauteed Garlic Spinach|Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir": "Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir: this elegant red's cherry-bright, silky-tannin frame meets this light, green vegetable's clean herbal edge. The elegant red's earthy edge meets light green or sweet root — cherry and earth hold the pairing together. A headliner match — context-driven peak. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
