  "Seafood Tower|Ketel One Vodka": "Ketel One with the seafood tower — pot-and-column Dutch wheat against the raw bar. Strong; Ketel handles the tower cleanly, though Goose's luxury softness wins the flagship pairing.",
  "Seafood Tower|Knickerbocker Gin": "Knickerbocker with the seafood tower — New Holland Artisan Spirits against the raw bar. Strong; Knickerbocker's brewer's-heritage character is a story-driven tower pairing.",
  "Seafood Tower|Knob Creek": "Knob Creek's oak-and-vanilla 100-proof depth drowns out the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- sweet-oak depth flattens the briny opener instead of lifting it. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a bourbon. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Hold the Knob Creek for the steak course.",
  "Seafood Tower|Knob Creek 12 Year": "Knob Creek 12 Year's aged 12 years at 100 proof crowds out the seafood tower's chilled shellfish lineup -- bourbon depth is wrong for the table's opening course. The plate deserves Laurent Perrier Le Cuvée Brut, Veuve Clicquot Brut, or Pierre Gimonnet Special Club Brut, not a bourbon. Avoid; the better calls are above. Hold the Knob Creek 12 Year for the steak course.",
