  "Seasonal Vegetables|St Supéry Cabernet Sauvignon": "St Supéry Cabernet Sauvignon's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth clashes with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate -- tannin on raw green vegetable reads astringent without payoff. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, not an elegant red. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Save the St Supéry Cabernet Sauvignon for the steak course.",
  "Seasonal Vegetables|St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc": "St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc's crisp white-wine character sits at register with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the bright acid lifts the seasonal vegetables, and the stone-fruit note underlines the side. Excellent; a confident headline pairing. Gold standard; the headline call at the table.",
  "Seasonal Vegetables|St Supéry Élu Meritage": "St Supéry Élu Meritage's Merlot-led Bordeaux blend with plush dark-fruit crowds the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate -- the side needs a crisper register to carry it cleanly. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, not an elegant red. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Pour the St Supéry Élu Meritage on the steak course instead.",
