  "Seasonal Vegetables|Villon Cognac": "Villon Cognac's modern profile and soft elderflower edge clashes with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate -- cognac on a green vegetable side is wrong direction — needs crisp white instead. The plate deserves St Supéry Sauvignon Blanc, not a cognac. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Villon Cognac lands on the steak course — not here.",
