  "Seasonal Vegetables|Weller 12 Year": "Weller 12 Year's aged wheated honey-vanilla character sits alongside the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the bourbon weight handles the seasonal vegetables, and the rounded sweetness brightens the side. Works; light body doesn't overshoot.",
