  "Seasonal Vegetables|Weller Special Reserve": "Weller Special Reserve's wheated soft-vanilla character finds neutral with the seasonal vegetables' seasonal garden plate: the bourbon depth settles into the seasonal vegetables, and the oak frames the side. Works; the bourbon-with-dessert pairing sits in the middle without contention.",
