  "Shafer 1.5|Market Fish": "Shafer 1.5's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth clashes with the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- tannin reads metallic against the fish's natural fats. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not an elegant red. Avoid; the better calls are above. Reserve the Shafer 1.5 for the steak course.",
