  "Shafer 1.5|Mushroom Bisque": "Shafer 1.5's bold coffee-juniper cassis sits alongside the mushroom bisque's earthy cream — the concentrated body matches the heavy soup, and the toffee-vanilla edge underlines the cream. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
