  "Shrimp Bisque|Elijah Craig Private Barrel": "Elijah Craig Private Barrel's grain-and-oak bourbon register reads alongside the shrimp bisque's creamy shellfish soup: the bourbon body sits with the shrimp bisque, and the vanilla brightens the cream. Works; the call holds at register.",
  "Shrimp Bisque|Elijah Craig Single Barrel": "Elijah Craig Single Barrel's warm-vanilla bourbon backbone finds neutral with the shrimp bisque's creamy shellfish soup: the oak-and-vanilla weight wraps the shrimp bisque, and the vanilla folds into the cream. Works; a safe alongside, no friction.",
