  "Shrimp Cocktail|El Mayor Reposado": "El Mayor Reposado with shrimp cocktail — value reposado against cold shrimp and cocktail sauce. The agave cuts the horseradish cleanly at the everyday tier. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Shrimp Cocktail|Elephant Gin": "Elephant Gin with shrimp cocktail — German-distilled African-botanical gin against cold shrimp. Excellent; Elephant's distinctive botanicals elevate the classic cold app with story-driven character — the gin for guests who want something with narrative.",
