  "Shrimp Cocktail|Macauley Stagecoach Vineyard": "Macauley Stagecoach Atlas Peak Cab against chilled sweet-briny shrimp — powerful iron-espresso is the wrong axis for cold shellfish and cocktail sauce. Never layer. Route shrimp cocktail to Champagne, Sancerre, or Chablis and save Macauley for steak where its celebrated-vineyard structure belongs.",
