  "Siete Leguas Blanco|Seasonal Soup": "Siete Leguas Blanco's silver-spirit lift with agave-citrus edge leans against the seasonal soup's house seasonal build: the silver-spirit register lifts the seasonal soup, and the agave-citrus thread frames the bowl. Works; composed but not a standout.",
