  "Siete Leguas Blanco|Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna": "Siete Leguas Blanco's agave-earth character sits with the tuna's seared rare crust — the crisp body frames the fish cleanly, and the agave-pepper carries the char. Strong; consistent recommendation worth pouring.",
  "Siete Leguas Blanco|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Siete Leguas Blanco's green-agave-and-cane lift sits alongside the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the unaged body brightens the curry, and the unaged-cane note plays against the bowl. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
