  "Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon|The Tomahawk": "Silver Oak — Alexander Valley Cab with American-oak vanilla, coconut, dill, ripe cassis, plum. The soft polished body can meet Tomahawk fat and char and the vanilla-dill frames the theatrical cut with the distinctive American-oak signature. Peak recognizable Cab for Tomahawk — name-recognition plus lushness for the big moment. Excellent; reliable headline pairing.",
