  "Swordfish|Baileys Irish Cream": "Baileys Irish Cream's sweet liqueur character clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- a sweet liqueur is dessert-course energy — wrong register for any main protein. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a digestif. Avoid; route the table to a better-fit pour. Baileys Irish Cream belongs on the steak course.",
  "Swordfish|Baker's": "Baker's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- bourbon's sweet weight crowds the rare crust's clean char. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; steer the table to the alternatives. Baker's lands on the steak course — not here.",
