  "Swordfish|Willett Pot Still Reserve": "Willett Pot Still Reserve's craft high-rye oak spice clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- bourbon's sweet weight crowds the rare crust's clean char. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; pick from the alternatives. Reserve the Willett Pot Still Reserve for the steak course.",
  "Swordfish|Woodford Reserve": "Woodford Reserve's small-batch fruit and floral clashes with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- bourbon's sweet weight crowds the rare crust's clean char. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; one of those is the move. Save the Woodford Reserve for the steak course.",
  "Swordfish|Woodford Reserve Double Oaked": "Woodford Reserve Double Oaked's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth flattens the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- oak-and-vanilla density rolls over the seared crust without lifting it. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not a bourbon. Avoid; one of those is the move. Woodford Reserve Double Oaked belongs on the steak course.",
