  "Tenuta di Arceno Chianti Classico|House Wedge": "Tuscany Chianti Classico DOCG Sangiovese — Arceno vibrant cherry, dried herbs, tomato leaf, savory earth, medium body, medium tannin, high acid. The high acid cuts iceberg-and-bacon and the vibrant cherry plays against blue cheese dressing. Works as Tuscan Sangiovese for the wedge — Italian table wine reframes the classic salad.",
