  "The BG|Grilled Caesar": "Grilled Caesar: the Grilled Caesar's charred romaine, anchovy umami, and bold creamy dressing meets this bold whiskey-forward cocktail's oak, spice, and spirit depth. Bold whiskey against the Caesar's char and umami — weight matches, but the flavors compete. Strong — both land heavy.",
  "The BG|Gumbo": "Traveller whiskey, honey lavender, grapefruit, black walnut bitters, ginger beer. The whiskey depth meets gumbo's dark-roux weight and the ginger beer adds lift against Cajun spice. Works as sessionable whiskey cocktail for gumbo — spirit-forward route on the stew classic; wines peak higher.",
