  "The Happy Wife|Faroe Island Salmon": "Tito's, orange juice, ginger syrup — stirred. The orange-and-ginger profile can meet salmon's fat well, though preparation changes seasonally — check with kitchen. Strong approachable cocktail option alongside the salmon for guests wanting easy-drinking.",
