  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character reads alongside the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the Japanese whisky balance frames the PB brownie, and the Japanese-craft balance underlines the dessert. Works; AE meets the char at wine-finish register.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Porterhouse": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky -- Suntory entry, light, citrus. The entry Suntory body sits with the dual-cut steak, and the citrus lifts the cut. Strong; Kentucky Owl St.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Prime Tartare": "Toki Suntory with the tartare — entry Suntory blend against raw beef. Strong; Toki's light-floral character supports tartare at crowd-pleasing register; Hibiki Harmony's refined-elegant premium is the featured Japanese-tartare match.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Rainbow Trout": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character sits alongside the trout's delicate flesh: the entry Suntory body sits with the trout, and the citrus lifts the plate. Works; HH 20 handles dessert density at collector register.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Roast Half Chicken": "Toki Suntory with the chicken — Suntory entry blend against roasted poultry. Excellent; Toki's light-floral Japanese-blend profile complements chicken at crowd-pleasing register.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Roasted Red Pepper Chickpea": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character finds neutral with the chickpea soup's roasted-pepper chickpea warmth: the Mizunara-influenced register sits with the chickpea soup, and the sandalwood-and-honey register softens the bowl. Works; annual-release complexity over-specified.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Salt-Cured Halibut": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character finds neutral with the halibut's salt-cured flesh: the elegant Suntory/Nikka register matches the halibut, and the umami-tinged finish frames the plate. Works; gentle composed match.",
