  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Shrimp Cocktail": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character sits alongside the shrimp cocktail's cool brine-and-citrus shellfish: the precise Japanese craft body wraps the chilled shrimp, and the precision rounds the starter. Works; the spicy-sweet character gives the dessert a Barton frame.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Swordfish": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character finds neutral with the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak: the entry Suntory body sits with the swordfish, and the citrus lifts the plate. Works; BIB structure is a touch over-specified for this dish.",
  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|The Tomahawk": "Toki Suntory with the Tomahawk — light-floral Japanese blend against 32oz cap-fat. Avoid; Japanese whisky's delicate character is wrong for this cut. Reach for a bourbon or cab.",
