  "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky|Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas": "Toki Suntory Japanese Whisky's entry Suntory Toki character leans against the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth: the entry Suntory body sits with the curry, and the citrus lifts the bowl. Works; grain notes don't really engage the soup but don't clash.",
