  "Tomato Basil|Canadian Club": "Canadian Club's workhorse Canadian blend finds neutral with the tomato basil's bright tomato-basil acid: the easygoing Canadian character handles the tomato basil, and the gentle rye thread underlines the bowl. Works; Fortuna handles the richness at distinctive register.",
