  "Tomato Basil|Casa LBV Port": "Casa LBV Port's dessert-wine sweetness clashes with the tomato basil's bright tomato-basil acid -- honeyed sugar on savory broth jars — wrong direction for the course. The plate deserves Stoneleigh Sauvignon Blanc, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Le Garenne Rosé, not a dessert wine. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Casa LBV Port belongs on the steak course.",
