  "Transfusion|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Transfusion's crisp citrus-ginger build sits alongside the carrots' honeyed sweetness — the cocktail lift sits with the light side, and the botanicals echo the green plate. Works; composed but not a standout.",
  "Transfusion|House Wedge": "Hangar 1 vodka muddled with black grapes and lime, ginger beer top. The tart grape and lime cut iceberg-and-bacon weight and the ginger beer's dry finish plays against blue cheese dressing. Peak tall-sessionable cocktail for the wedge — fruit-led freshness meets classic salad.",
