  "Transfusion|Peanut Butter Brownie": "Transfusion's gin-or-tequila cocktail lift reads alongside the PB brownie's peanut-butter-and-chocolate fudge: the bright build frames the PB brownie, and the citrus cuts the dessert. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
