  "Transfusion|Prime Tartare": "Hangar 1 vodka, muddled black grapes, lime, ginger beer. The grape's slight tannin and lime brightness cut raw prime beef's iron richness without crushing. Strong unconventional pre-dinner pairing — the Transfusion's fruit adds contrast against the beef.",
