  "Transfusion|Seafood Tower": "Seafood Tower: chilled shellfish lineup meets Transfusion. Excellent; Concord-grape + ginger-ale + vodka cocktail's bright-fruit-ginger character cuts through the salty lineup at approachable register.",
  "Transfusion|Seared Scallops": "Hangar 1, muddled black grapes, lime, ginger beer top. The fruit-forward profile meets scallops' clean-seared sweetness and the ginger beer's dry finish cleans the pairing. Strong refreshing cocktail for scallops — lighter than classic martinis while still pairing well.",
