  "Transfusion|Shrimp Cocktail": "Hangar 1 vodka muddled with black grapes and lime, topped with ginger beer. The grape fruit and ginger-beer effervescence keep the drink light enough for cold shrimp. More complex than it looks; honest fit. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Transfusion|Swordfish": "Transfusion's crisp citrus-ginger build holds steady against the swordfish's meaty flesh — the cocktail lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
  "Transfusion|The Tomahawk": "Fruit-forward sessionable vodka cocktail against the biggest steak on the menu — zero structural overlap. Ginger beer and grape have no weight to meet marbled Tomahawk fat. Never pair — route Tomahawk to Cab, Barolo, or spirit-forward whiskey cocktails.",
