  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Creamed Spinach": "Trombo Cedano Reposado's añejo-pour depth sits alongside the creamed spinach's rich bechamel-laced greens: the añejo register carries the creamed spinach, and the caramel-agave register brightens the side. Works; multi-cask complexity handles richness at luxury register.",
