  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Faroe Island Salmon": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the salmon — cedar-aged reposado against salmon richness. Strong; cedar and salmon work (cedar plank salmon echoes here) but the pairing is a novelty more than a standout.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Filet Mignon": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the filet — cedar-wood-aged reposado against the 10oz cut. The pine and cedar notes give the filet a singular frame; a curiosity pour for adventurous guests. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|French Onion": "Trombo Cedano Reposado's rested-agave body reads alongside the French onion's beef-broth-and-gruyere depth: the cooked-agave-and-oak body matches the French onion, and the vanilla-and-pepper edge frames the bowl. Works; safe call, not the headline.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Grilled Caesar": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the grilled Caesar — cedar-wood-aged against charred romaine and anchovy. The cedar and char meet at a distinctive register; a standout unconventional pairing. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Gumbo": "Trombo Cedano Reposado's rested-agave body finds neutral with the gumbo's spiced creole stew: the aged-agave weight wraps the gumbo, and the vanilla-and-pepper edge frames the bowl. Works; multi-cask complexity over-specified for two-cut plate.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Honey Roasted Carrots": "Trombo Cedano Reposado's aged-agave character leans against the honey carrots' honey-glazed carrot sweetness: the añejo register carries the honey carrots, and the oak threads the side. Works; accessible aged sits with richness.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|House Wedge": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the House Wedge — cedar-aged reposado against iceberg and bleu. The distinctive pine notes cut the bleu with a character no other reposado brings. Excellent; the call holds at full register.",
  "Trombo Cedano Reposado|Kansas City": "Trombo Cedano Reposado with the KC — aged in cedar-wood barrels. Distinctive cedar and pine notes atop agave; a singular character pour with nothing else on the menu quite like it. The cedar gives the strip's char a forest-floor counterpoint. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
