  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Bardstown Foursquare": "Bardstown Foursquare's rum-cask + cocoa is textbook — tropical-rum + chocolate flattens the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- oak-and-vanilla density rolls over the seared crust without lifting it. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not a bourbon. Avoid; one of those is the move. Bardstown Foursquare lands on the steak course — not here.",
