  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal": "Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal's smoky agave character doubles down on the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- mezcal smoke and the seared crust double up smoky char without contrast. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not a mezcal. Avoid; the better calls are above. Save the Clase Azul Guerrero Mezcal for the steak course.",
