  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Don Fulano Anejo": "Don Fulano Anejo's aged-agave character fights the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- the cask-aged agave register pulls against the savory sear. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not an añejo tequila. Avoid; the better calls are above. Save the Don Fulano Anejo for the steak course.",
