  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Escargot": "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna with the escargot as the lead-in -- the sesame crust holds with the herb-bright snail plate. Strong; the starter sets the table for the tuna.",
