  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Keenan Chardonnay": "Keenan Chardonnay's bold apple-butter acidity lifts the tuna's seared rare crust — the crisp acidity frames the fish cleanly, and the smoke meets the char. Strong; the match carries without overshooting.",
