  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Milagro Reposado": "Milagro Reposado's rested-agave body finds neutral with the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust: the añejo register carries the tuna, and the caramel-agave register brightens the plate. Works; Riedel-luxury over-specified.",
  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Mister Sam Tribute Whiskey": "Mister Sam Tribute Whiskey's oak-and-vanilla bourbon depth clashes with the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- bourbon's sweet weight crowds the rare crust's clean char. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not a bourbon. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Mister Sam Tribute Whiskey lands on the steak course — not here.",
