  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Monkey 47 Gin": "Monkey 47 Gin's crisp Black-Forest-botanical botanicals finds register with the tuna's seared rare crust — the botanical lift frames the fish cleanly, and the botanicals frame the umami depth. Strong; reliable headline pairing.",
