  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Peanut Butter Brownie": "After the tuna, the PB brownie -- the rare yellowfin yields to peanut-and-chocolate fudge, vanilla ice cream tempering the close. Works; the close runs heavier than the main called for, but the contrast holds.",
