  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Poderi Aldo Conterno Nebbiolo": "Poderi Aldo Conterno Nebbiolo's high-acid Nebbiolo with rose-and-tar grip clashes with the tuna's seared-rare flesh with sesame crust -- tannin reads metallic against the fish's natural fats. The plate deserves Pommery Cuvée Louise, Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, or Elk Cove Pinot Blanc, not an elegant red. Avoid; offer the alts at the table — they fit. Reserve the Poderi Aldo Conterno Nebbiolo for the steak course.",
  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Pommery Cuvée Louise": "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna: sesame-crusted rare tuna meets Pommery Cuvée Louise. Excellent; prestige cuvée's mineral-lean character frames the rare-fish-and-sesame at tête-de-cuvée register. Gold standard; pour without second-guessing.",
  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Prime Tartare": "The tuna after the tartare -- the seared-rare yellowfin plays against the briny tartare. Strong; the starter composes cleanly before the main.",
