  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|Schloss Vollrads Riesling": "Schloss Vollrads Riesling's crisp apricot-floral acidity holds the line with the tuna's seared rare crust — the crisp acidity frames the fish cleanly, and the mineral edge lifts the fish. Strong; the call lands cleanly.",
