  "Tuxedo-Crusted Yellowfin Tuna|The Happy Wife": "Tito's, orange juice, ginger syrup. The ginger plays against honey sambal's spice and the orange juice lifts rare-seared tuna's lean flesh. Works as light cocktail for tuxedo tuna — simple-and-bright route; wines peak higher as dedicated pairings.",
