  "Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas|Le Garenne Rosé": "Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas: this spiced vegetable curry's warm, complex aromatic lift meets this dry Provence-style rosé's red-fruit freshness and light weight. Crisp, vegetal wine mirrors the soup's bright herbal lift. A same-register headliner. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
  "Vegetable Curry with Chickpeas|Le Ragnaie Brunello": "Le Ragnaie Brunello's Sangiovese-driven Tuscan acidity overwhelms the curry's spiced chickpea-curry warmth -- the red is built for protein weight, not a light soup or salad base. The plate deserves Schloss Vollrads Riesling, Lingua Franca Avni Pinot Noir, or Le Garenne Rosé, not an elegant red. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Pour the Le Ragnaie Brunello on the steak course instead.",
