  "Venge Scout's Honor|Shrimp Bisque": "Venge Scout's Honor's bold pepper-vanilla cassis leans against the bisque's creamy shellfish soup — the concentrated body matches the heavy soup, and the rounded sweetness brightens the cream. Works; reliable companion, low risk.",
  "Venge Scout's Honor|Shrimp Cocktail": "Never pair Venge Scout's Honor with shrimp cocktail — the Zin-led full body and ripe fruit overshadow cold poached shrimp and the generous alcohol clashes with cocktail-sauce horseradish. Lead with Veuve Clicquot, Raventós Cava, or French 75. Scout's Honor lives on the red-meat course.",
  "Venge Scout's Honor|Swordfish": "Venge Scout's Honor's jammy Zinfandel with bramble-and-pepper lift overshadows the swordfish's meaty swordfish steak -- dark-fruit weight crowds the seared sesame crust — needs a sparkling or crisp white for lift. The plate deserves Far Niente Chardonnay, Schloss Vollrads Riesling, or Keenan Chardonnay, not an elegant red. Avoid; one of those is the move. Hold the Venge Scout's Honor for the steak course.",
  "Venge Scout's Honor|The Tomahawk": "Napa Zin-led blend — Kirk Venge's Scout's Honor, blackberry, boysenberry, black pepper, vanilla, full body, generous finish. Full body approaches the 40oz bone-in but Zin-led fruit reads sweeter than Tomahawk's smoky-char demands. Works for Tomahawk — Silver Oak or Opus One peaks higher on the grand cut.",
  "Venge Scout's Honor|Tomato Basil": "Venge Scout's Honor's bold pepper-vanilla cassis reads alongside the tomato basil's bright acid — the opulent body overshoots the light soup, and the caramel rounds the herb butter. Works; capable alongside. Works; capable alongside without driving the table.",
  "Venge Scout's Honor|Truffle Fries": "Napa Zin-led blend — Kirk Venge's Scout's Honor, blackberry, boysenberry, black pepper, vanilla, full body, generous finish. The vanilla meets truffle-oil earth directly and the black pepper cuts parmesan weight. Peak Zin-led for truffle fries — jammy fruit handles the indulgent side. Excellent; servers pour without second-guessing.",
