  "Venge Silencieux|Au Gratin Potatoes": "Kirk Venge single-vineyard Napa — dark cherry, cassis, chocolate, floral violet, silky soft tannin. The silky tannin cuts gruyère-cream weight and the chocolate plays against the lactic richness. Works as winemaker's Napa Cab for au gratin — Venge precision on the cheesy side.",
  "Venge Silencieux|Beignets": "Venge Silencieux's structured Cabernet with cassis-and-cedar depth jars against the beignets' warm sugar-dusted pastry -- savory tannin meets dessert sugar with no bridge between them. The plate deserves Kahlua, Ron Zacapa Rum, or G.D. Vajra Moscato d'Asti, not an elegant red. Avoid; recommend one of the alternatives. Pour the Venge Silencieux on the steak course instead.",
