  "Vesper|Burrata": "Nolet's, Ketel One, Lillet. The cocktail's elegant clean profile plays against burrata's creamy-basil delicacy and Nolet's rose-peach botanicals add aromatic layering. Strong martini pairing — cocktail's dryness balances the burrata's softness.",
  "Vesper|Butternut Squash": "Vesper's crisp citrus-juniper build plays cleanly against the squash soup's silky sweet — the cocktail lift sits with the light soup, and the citrus brightens the cream. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
