  "Vesper|House Wedge": "Nolet's gin, Ketel One vodka, Lillet — stirred cold. The cocktail's clean structure cuts iceberg-and-bacon weight and Lillet's citrus-bitter plays against blue cheese dressing. Strong opener pairing — the wedge's layered components meet the martini's composure.",
