  "Vesper|Prime Tartare": "Nolet's gin, Ketel One vodka, Lillet — stirred. The cocktail's clean structure meets raw prime beef's iron richness and Lillet's citrus-bitter adds complexity against tartare seasoning. Peak martini pairing for the hand-cut beef — sophistication matched.",
  "Vesper|Rainbow Trout": "Vesper's crisp citrus-juniper build finds register with the trout's delicate flesh — the cocktail lift frames the fish cleanly, and the citrus sharpens the briny edge. Strong; a steady recommendation at the table.",
