  "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World|Loaded Potato": "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World's rye-spice character leans against the loaded potato's rich loaded-potato soup: the rye spice cuts the loaded potato soup, and the oak rounds the cream. Works; the match reads neutral at the table.",
  "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World|Lobster Mac": "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World's rye-spice character sits alongside the lobster mac's shellfish-in-cream indulgence: the high-rye spice register matches the lobster mac, and the oak depth lays under the cream. Works; bonded weight a touch ambitious for the dessert.",
  "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World|Market Fish": "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World's rye-spice character overwhelms the market fish's clean white-fish flesh -- bourbon depth belongs with red meat, not flaky white fish. The plate deserves Joseph Mellot Sancerre or Jean-Pierre Grossot Chablis, not a rye whiskey. Avoid; lead with the alternatives instead. Pour the WhistlePig 12 Year Old World on the steak course instead.",
