  "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World|Porterhouse": "WhistlePig 12 Year Old World with the porterhouse — 12-year Old World rye across strip and filet. The wine-cask complexity covers both cuts with more fruit-forward character than WP 10 Year single-barrel; a refined porterhouse rye. Excellent; the pairing carries cleanly.",
